Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.57,0:01:28.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're eighteen?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.86,0:01:30.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why? Do I look older?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.53,0:01:42.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Alberta Scrubb? - It's a typographical error.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.78,0:01:45.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It is suppose to be Albert A. Scrubb.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.41,0:01:46.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.96,0:01:49.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,you are suppose to be helping me with the groceries.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.81,0:01:55.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Better luck next time, eh, squirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.11,0:02:05.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Squirt? He barely had 2 years on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.02,0:02:10.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I am a king. I've fought wars and I've led armies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.82,0:02:12.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Not in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.25,0:02:14.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, instead I'm stuck here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.89,0:02:17.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Doing battles with Eustace Clarence Scrubb.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.97,0:02:19.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If anyone so deserve a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.59,0:02:23.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.21,0:02:27.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Nothing. Come on then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.46,0:02:36.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Dear Diary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.37,0:02:39.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It is now day 253
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.30,0:02:42.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,since my wretched cousins Edmund and Lucy invaded our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.50,0:02:44.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Not sure how much long I can cope living with them...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.96,0:02:46.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,having to share my things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.52,0:02:50.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If only one could treat relatives like one who treat insects,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.21,0:02:52.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,all my problems would be solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.39,0:02:55.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I could simply put them in a jar,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.76,0:02:58.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- pin them to my wall? - I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.04,0:02:59.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.94,0:03:01.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Note to self.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.98,0:03:05.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Investigate legal ramifications of impaling relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.46,0:03:11.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And that concludes the war news from the western front.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.27,0:03:12.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello, Uncle Harold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.70,0:03:13.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I've tried to find some carrots
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.95,0:03:15.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but all they had were turnips again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.43,0:03:17.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Should I start making soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.46,0:03:19.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Aunt Alberta is on her way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:26.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Uncle Harold? - Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.02,0:03:28.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund making faces at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.51,0:03:31.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why, you little...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:32.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Father, he's going to hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.06,0:03:35.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund look, it's from Susan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.77,0:03:38.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I do wish you were here with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.08,0:03:39.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It is such an adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.27,0:03:42.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But nothing like our times in Narnia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.05,0:03:44.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,America is very exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.16,0:03:48.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Except we never see father. He works so very hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.99,0:03:50.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was invited to the British consul's tea party this week
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.49,0:03:53.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,by a naval officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.35,0:03:57.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who happens to be very handsome. I think he fancies me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.57,0:03:59.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It seems that the Germans
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.67,0:04:01.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,have made the crossing difficult right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.85,0:04:02.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Time are hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:04.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother hopes you both won't mind
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:05.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,another few months in Cambridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.49,0:04:10.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Another few months? How will we survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.08,0:04:13.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're lucky. At least you've got your own room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:15.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm stuck with mullet mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.32,0:04:17.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Susan and Peter are the lucky ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.14,0:04:20.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Off on adventures. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.86,0:04:22.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They are the olders we are the youngest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.64,0:04:25.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We don't matter as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.23,0:04:28.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you think I look anything like Susan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:33.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy, have you seen this ship before?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.36,0:04:37.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's very Narnian looking isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.29,0:04:42.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Just another reminder that we're here not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.05,0:04:46.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There once was two orphans who wasted their time
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.78,0:04:48.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,believing in Narnian nursery rhyme.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.99,0:04:50.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Please let me hit him! - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:52.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Don't you ever knock? - It's my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.71,0:04:53.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I do as I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.79,0:04:54.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're just guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.48,0:04:58.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's so fascinating about that picture anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.81,0:04:59.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's hideous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.19,0:05:02.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You won't see it from the outside of the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.31,0:05:06.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund look, looks like the water is actually moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.31,0:05:07.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What rubbish, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.23,0:05:08.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's what happens when
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.54,0:05:11.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,you read all those fancy little novels and fairy tales of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.63,0:05:13.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There once was a boy called Eustace,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.47,0:05:15.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,who read books full of facts that were useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.45,0:05:18.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,People who read fairy tales are always the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.60,0:05:21.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,sort who become a hideous burden to people like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.25,0:05:22.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I read books with real information.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.94,0:05:24.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,A hideous burden?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.27,0:05:27.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you lift a finger since we've been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.43,0:05:30.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I have a mind to tell your father
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.58,0:05:32.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,you who stole Aunt Alberta's sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:34.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Liar? - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.38,0:05:35.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund, the painting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:37.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I found them under your bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:40.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And you know what? I licked every one of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.83,0:05:42.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ew! I'm infected with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.49,0:05:50.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What is going on here? - Lucy, do you think...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.47,0:05:51.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.35,0:05:52.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop or I'll tell mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:05:55.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.89,0:05:59.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll just smash the rotten thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.31,0:06:02.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Eustace! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.04,0:06:02.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We can't stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.11,0:06:03.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get off me! Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.98,0:06:05.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let go of it, Eustace!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.18,0:06:07.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Put it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.32,0:06:08.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.53,0:06:37.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.91,0:06:48.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Eustace, swim! - What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.21,0:06:51.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.43,0:06:53.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,keep swimming!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:05.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's alright! I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.15,0:07:09.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Caspian? - Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.74,0:07:11.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund, it is Caspian.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.19,0:07:13.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's all right, boys. You're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.01,0:07:14.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Are we in Narnia?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.93,0:07:16.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, you are in Narnia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.94,0:07:20.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna go. I want to go back to England!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.30,0:07:21.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going back to England!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.56,0:07:23.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.20,0:07:45.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That was thrilling!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:47.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How in the world do you end up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.93,0:07:49.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.56,0:07:50.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Caspian!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.24,0:07:53.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.35,0:07:54.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's great to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.38,0:07:55.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Great to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:56.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Didn't you call for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.89,0:07:58.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.78,0:08:02.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever the case, I'm just glad to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.61,0:08:08.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Now calm down, sir. - Ahh! Get that thing off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.53,0:08:13.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Reepicheep!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.97,0:08:17.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Your Majesty. - Hello, Reep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.79,0:08:20.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What a pleasure. - The pleasure is all mine, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.76,0:08:23.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But first, what to do about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.64,0:08:25.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,this hysterical interloper?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.38,0:08:28.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That giant rat thing just tried to claw my face off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.60,0:08:32.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was merely trying to expel the water from your lungs sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.44,0:08:35.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He talks! Did you see? Did anyone just hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.23,0:08:36.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- It just talked! - He always talks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.02,0:08:39.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's getting him to shut up that's the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.06,0:08:41.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The moment there is nothing to be said your highness,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.34,0:08:43.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I promise you I will not say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.55,0:08:45.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind of prank this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.66,0:08:47.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I wanna wake up right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.06,0:08:49.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we can throw him back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.13,0:08:53.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.64,0:08:57.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I demand to know just where in the blazes am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:09:01.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're on the Dawn Treader. The finest ship in Narnia's navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.65,0:09:09.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Was it something I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:12.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- See to him, will you? - Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.10,0:09:17.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.21,0:09:20.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Behold our castaways.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.29,0:09:25.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund the Just and Lucy the Valiant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.28,0:09:28.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,High King and Queen of Narnia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.28,0:09:59.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Aslan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.97,0:10:10.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look! Susan's bow and arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.77,0:10:11.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.49,0:10:16.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My Healing Cordial and dagger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.86,0:10:20.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- oh, May I? - Of course. They are yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.65,0:10:22.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Peter's sword. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.64,0:10:25.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I looked after as promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.07,0:10:29.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Here. Hold it if you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.62,0:10:33.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, it's yours. Peter has given it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.53,0:10:37.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I did saved this for you though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.54,0:10:43.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.93,0:10:47.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Since you've left, the Giants
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.09,0:10:48.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,of the North surrendered unconditionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.89,0:10:51.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And we defeated the Calormen armies at the Great Desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.02,0:10:54.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- There is peace across all of Narnia. - Peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.25,0:10:56.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,For three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.25,0:10:59.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And have you found yourself a queen in those three years?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.77,0:11:04.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No. Not one to compare to your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.07,0:11:05.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hang on, so there are no wars to fight
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.67,0:11:07.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and no one is in trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.08,0:11:09.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Then, why are we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.37,0:11:10.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.61,0:11:12.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I have been asking myself the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.75,0:11:13.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So, where are we sailing this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.35,0:11:16.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,To get back the throne from my uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.67,0:11:17.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He tried to kill my father's
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:19.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,closest friends and most loyal supporters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.85,0:11:22.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The seven Lords of Telmar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.14,0:11:28.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They fled to the Lone Islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.13,0:11:31.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No one has heard from them since.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.56,0:11:35.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So you think something has happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.53,0:11:39.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, if it has, it is my duty to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:43.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's east of the Lone Islands?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:47.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Uncharted waters. Things that you can barely imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.80,0:11:51.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tales of sea serpents and worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.64,0:11:54.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sea serpents?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.79,0:11:57.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Alright captain, enough of your tall tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.20,0:12:14.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where sky and water meet, where the waves grow ever sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.47,0:12:18.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Doubt not, you Reepicheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.96,0:12:24.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,To find all that you seek, there is the Utter East.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.22,0:12:25.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Doubt not...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.40,0:12:27.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's pretty! - Oh! Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.16,0:12:31.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,A dryad sung it to me when I was just a mouseling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.45,0:12:36.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't divine the meaning but I never forgotten the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.19,0:12:38.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you think is past the Lone Islands, Reep?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.05,0:12:40.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been told the furthest east one can sail
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.87,0:12:42.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,is to the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.34,0:12:44.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Aslan's country.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.41,0:12:46.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you really believe there is such a place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.73,0:12:49.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We have nothing if we do not believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.28,0:12:54.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can actually sail there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.63,0:12:57.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, there is only one way of finding that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.61,0:13:00.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Only hope one day I'd earn the right to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.51,0:13:02.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.85,0:14:04.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You have grown stronger, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.11,0:14:06.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Seems I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.86,0:14:10.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Alright! Back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:14.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Your Highness. - Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.01,0:14:21.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund, Do you think if we keep sailing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.63,0:14:22.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,to the end of the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.53,0:14:26.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,we just... tip off the edge?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.49,0:14:29.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Lu. We're long way from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.23,0:14:31.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I see you're still talking nonsense, the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.61,0:14:34.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling better?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.53,0:14:36.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, but not thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.54,0:14:38.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's lucky I have an iron constitution.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.57,0:14:40.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,As effervescent as ever, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.58,0:14:42.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Found your sea legs? - Never lost them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.91,0:14:44.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Simply dealing with the shock of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.18,0:14:48.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother says I have an acute disposition, due to my intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.35,0:14:51.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't think he has "acute" anything
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.66,0:14:53.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll have you all know as soon as we find civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.99,0:14:55.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm contacting the British Consul.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.39,0:14:57.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Have you all arrested for kidnapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.79,0:14:59.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Kidnapping, is it? That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.36,0:15:01.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought we had saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.84,0:15:03.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You held me here against my will!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.96,0:15:04.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.74,0:15:07.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,In, what I must say, are the most unhygienic quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.33,0:15:08.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's like, like a zoo down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.17,0:15:12.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- He's quite the complainer, isn't he? - He is just warming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.96,0:15:14.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Land ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.70,0:15:40.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The Lone Islands. Narrow Haven's portal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.22,0:15:43.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Strange. No a Narnia flag in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.14,0:15:47.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But the Lone Islands have always been Narnia's.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:51.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Seems suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.91,0:15:55.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I say we prepare a landing party.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:16:00.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Drinian? - Forgive me, Your Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.37,0:16:04.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But the chain of command starts with Prince Caspian on this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.34,0:16:07.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Right. - We'll use longboats.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.74,0:16:09.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Drinian, pick some men and come ashore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.35,0:16:10.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.10,0:16:10.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tavros.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.83,0:16:16.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Men the longboats, furl the sail and prepare to drop anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.68,0:16:35.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Onward! The thrill of the unknown lies ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.24,0:16:37.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Can't we just wait till the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.33,0:16:41.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There is no honor in turning away from adventure, lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.68,0:16:44.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen! Where is everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.19,0:16:49.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on, jelly legs. - I'm capable of doing it myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.60,0:16:54.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And you're certain he's related by blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.26,0:17:18.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Reepicheep,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.38,0:17:21.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,stay here with Drinian's men and secure the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.46,0:17:23.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We will head up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.84,0:17:25.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If we don't come back by dawn,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.11,0:17:28.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- send the party. - Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.72,0:17:44.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, looks like nobody is in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.99,0:17:46.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So do you think we should go back?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.98,0:17:52.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you want to come here and guard...something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:56.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes. Good idea, cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.93,0:17:59.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Very..Um, logical.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.45,0:18:11.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I've got it. I've got it. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.78,0:18:33.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to go when you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.77,0:18:45.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who are all these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.82,0:18:47.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why are they've been crossed out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.14,0:18:51.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Looks like some kind of... fee?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.36,0:18:53.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Slave traders.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.30,0:18:59.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.73,0:19:18.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to hear this scum
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.19,0:19:20.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,squeal like a girl again,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.95,0:19:23.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I would say, you should drop your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.44,0:19:25.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Like a girl. - Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.02,0:19:30.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Put it down! - Eustace
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.79,0:19:34.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Put them in irons. - Come here you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.98,0:19:35.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.18,0:19:38.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Take these two to the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.36,0:19:38.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.87,0:19:40.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Send those other two to the dungeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.12,0:19:44.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, you insolent fool. I am your king!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.91,0:19:48.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're gonna pay for that! - Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.55,0:19:51.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,someone else is going to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.81,0:19:55.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,For all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.59,0:19:57.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- No! Edmund! - Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.14,0:20:13.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You all right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.25,0:20:23.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It is hopeless. You'll never get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.57,0:20:27.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Who's there? - Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.79,0:20:29.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just a voice in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.22,0:20:42.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lord Bern?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.64,0:20:50.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That was me once. I do not no longer deserve that title anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:53.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is he one of the seven?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.23,0:21:05.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your face. You remind me of a king that I once know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.57,0:21:08.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That man was my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.17,0:21:12.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My Lord, please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.59,0:21:14.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.63,0:21:19.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.73,0:21:20.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Helaine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.91,0:21:21.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.54,0:21:29.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.47,0:21:31.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.73,0:21:32.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.05,0:21:35.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.38,0:21:36.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay with daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.53,0:21:38.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I will find you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.52,0:21:40.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.60,0:21:56.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where are they taking them? - Keep watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.40,0:22:29.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What happened? - It's a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.02,0:22:33.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where did they go? - No one knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.85,0:22:37.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The mist was first seen in the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.99,0:22:41.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Reports of fishermen and sailors disappearing out at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.98,0:22:44.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We lords have made a pact...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.37,0:22:47.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,to find the source of the mist and to destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.35,0:22:48.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They each set sail,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.88,0:22:51.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But none of them came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.59,0:22:59.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You see, If they don't sell you to the slave traders
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.47,0:23:02.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're likely to be fed to the mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.74,0:23:04.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We have to find Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.13,0:23:06.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.42,0:23:08.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I offer 60. - I bid 80!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.58,0:23:10.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,100 for the little lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.42,0:23:13.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- 120! - 150.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:15.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Anymore bids?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.75,0:23:20.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sold!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.51,0:23:23.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.34,0:23:24.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,move!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.34,0:23:28.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And now, for this fine specimen!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.51,0:23:30.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who'd kick off the bidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.28,0:23:34.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on now, he may not seem like much,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.81,0:23:36.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but uh..He is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.76,0:23:38.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, he's strong alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.10,0:23:41.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Smells like the rear end of a Minotaur.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.14,0:23:43.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That is an outrageous lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.01,0:23:46.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I won the school hygeine award, two years running!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.28,0:23:50.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, someone make your bid!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.41,0:23:52.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll take them off your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.38,0:23:54.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll take them all out of your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.98,0:23:56.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,For Narnia!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.98,0:24:20.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Reep. I knew you would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.91,0:24:21.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.50,0:24:30.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Grab the keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.43,0:24:39.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Keys!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.87,0:25:17.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,oh, you're a boat in a magical land.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.53,0:25:19.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Can't you row yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.65,0:25:41.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I hope that wasn't British consul.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.12,0:25:44.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.25,0:25:46.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Your majesty! - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.09,0:25:48.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My wife was taken just this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.08,0:25:49.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.33,0:25:51.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I beg you, take me with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.33,0:25:54.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I want to come. - No, Gael. Stay with your aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.15,0:25:56.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I am a fight sailor,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.68,0:25:58.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,been on the seas my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.82,0:26:01.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Of course, you must. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.07,0:26:03.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- But Daddy! - If I ever not come back...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.82,0:26:07.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.87,0:26:14.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My king!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.87,0:26:16.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My king!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.20,0:26:22.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This was given to me by your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.51,0:26:25.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I hid it safely in the cave. All these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.61,0:26:27.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought that is Narnian sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.12,0:26:29.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's from your Golden Age.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.05,0:26:31.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There are seven of those swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.12,0:26:34.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Gifts from Aslan to protect Narnia.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.07,0:26:37.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your father entrusted them to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.37,0:26:39.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Here. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.06,0:26:45.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And it may protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.39,0:26:56.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.30,0:26:59.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And we shall find your lost sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.68,0:27:04.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.25,0:27:24.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Dear diary. There has been extraordinary turn of event.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.89,0:27:26.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I have been abducted by my cousins
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.84,0:27:28.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and set to drift in uncharted waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.67,0:27:31.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,In some ridiculously looking boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.07,0:27:31.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.84,0:27:34.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,as I share quarters with obnoxious mouse thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.93,0:27:38.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,my thought banking with my cousins was bad enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.26,0:27:41.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So far, every person I met in this strange place
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.67,0:27:44.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,suffers from the most Florit delusions,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.13,0:27:48.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,chasing for green mists and looking for lost lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.00,0:27:52.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I can only assume this is the result of poor diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.17,0:27:55.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Everyone are barking mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.98,0:27:59.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cousin Edmund is no exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.00,0:28:02.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He spends every spare second rubbing that thin sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.59,0:28:04.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Like it's some magic lantern.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.28,0:28:06.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Poor fool clearly needs a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.09,0:28:07.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It is going to be magnificient.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.74,0:28:09.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do they come in a smaller size?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.60,0:28:14.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peeving Marmud he's more delusional than my cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.70,0:28:21.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,In England we have mousetraps and that sort of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.63,0:28:26.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Speaking of food, do you think I can get any do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.49,0:28:30.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh, why you talking to that bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.13,0:28:33.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I just naturally assumed that...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.22,0:28:36.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's talking to birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.10,0:28:39.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He is as mad as a looner that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.46,0:28:43.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shoo! Go go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.55,0:29:09.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you aware sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.88,0:29:12.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stealing rations is a capital offense?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.45,0:29:15.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.97,0:29:18.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.07,0:29:21.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Men have been killed for less. - For What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.51,0:29:25.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Treason and sneakiness...and general nuisances.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.19,0:29:28.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just hand over the orange and we'll let the matter pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.20,0:29:29.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.65,0:29:31.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Allow me to...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.34,0:29:35.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I've had quite enough of you. - Unhand the tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.68,0:29:38.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The Great Aslan himself gave me this tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.25,0:29:42.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No one. Repeat. No one touches the tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.10,0:29:45.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Period. Exclamation mark! - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.42,0:29:49.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now. I will have the orange, then I will have satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.44,0:29:51.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Puh, puh, please, please, please, um. I'm a pacifist.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.38,0:29:59.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Watch it. - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.72,0:30:05.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.66,0:30:07.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We're on a boat you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.08,0:30:09.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Can't we just discuss this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.61,0:30:12.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That is for stealing, that is for lying,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.45,0:30:14.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and that was for good measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.14,0:30:21.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit! We have ourselves a duel! Catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.00,0:30:25.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, come on. Take your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.82,0:30:27.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that it? Come on, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.84,0:30:34.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop flapping your wings like a drunken pelican.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.53,0:30:36.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hoist!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.49,0:30:38.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Keep your leg up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.96,0:30:48.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo! Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.31,0:30:52.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,On your foot. On your left, your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.19,0:30:55.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Got it? Come on. The Nimble.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.30,0:30:56.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It is a dance, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.68,0:30:59.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on now. And again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.85,0:31:03.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.44,0:31:12.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And that!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.13,0:31:20.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.68,0:31:26.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Gael, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.62,0:31:47.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It seems that we have an extra crew member.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.82,0:31:58.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Welcome aboard. - Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.25,0:32:00.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Call me Lucy. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.32,0:32:04.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, look lovely, back to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.63,0:32:08.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Good match!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.47,0:32:10.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I will make a swordsman of you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.08,0:32:14.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.05,0:32:16.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,it's the plane we look more even
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.33,0:32:18.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,it would be an entirely different result.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.34,0:32:21.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.88,0:32:34.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It looks like uninhabited.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.20,0:32:36.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If the Lords follow the mist to the east,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.77,0:32:38.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,they would have stopped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.74,0:32:40.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It could be a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.70,0:32:44.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Or it can held some answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.18,0:32:45.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Caspian?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.69,0:32:49.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We spend the night on shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.66,0:32:51.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Scout the island everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.32,0:32:52.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ay, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.24,0:33:14.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Seems they have brought a pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.86,0:33:22.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This one. It's female.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.18,0:33:25.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So is this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.91,0:33:29.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This one reads.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.69,0:33:32.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.51,0:34:09.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There is no escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.16,0:34:11.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We are scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.74,0:34:12.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.90,0:34:15.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We are terrifying invisible beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.38,0:34:18.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If you could see us, you would be really intimidated.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.80,0:34:22.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You forgot to mention that we all are very large.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.46,0:34:23.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.89,0:34:25.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll do what we ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.73,0:34:26.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She will!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.64,0:34:28.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Very clear. Well put!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.39,0:34:32.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Or what? - Or death.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.47,0:34:34.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Death.Death! Death!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.35,0:34:38.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Death! Death! Death! Death!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.01,0:34:42.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I won't be much use to you when I'm dead now, would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.92,0:34:44.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I haven't thought of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.42,0:34:46.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, you hadn't. Fair point.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.98,0:34:50.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Alright. Then we'll just kill your friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.18,0:34:55.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Good idea. - What do you want with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.01,0:35:00.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll enter the house of the Oppressor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.58,0:35:03.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What house? - This one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.14,0:35:14.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Upstairs, you'll find the book of incantation
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.05,0:35:17.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,recite the spell that makes the unseen, seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.37,0:35:21.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Well put chief, well put. - Very. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.62,0:35:25.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, go on. We haven't got all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.71,0:35:27.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Remember what will happen to your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.48,0:35:30.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You've been warned. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.32,0:35:32.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.97,0:35:37.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't you do it yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.15,0:35:38.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We can't read.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.62,0:35:41.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Can't write for the matter of fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.83,0:35:44.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- All that. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.67,0:35:47.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you just say so?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.26,0:35:52.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Beware of the opressor. - He is very aggressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.53,0:35:54.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What makes the unseen, seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.76,0:35:57.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Got it? Don't forget that!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.68,0:36:14.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ed, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.47,0:36:16.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wake up! Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.25,0:36:26.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.70,0:36:29.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy? Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.28,0:36:30.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody up!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.34,0:36:33.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get up. I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.60,0:36:37.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- This way. - Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.02,0:37:44.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,With these words, your tongue must sew.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.91,0:37:48.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,For all around there to be snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.43,0:38:41.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,An infallible spell to make you she,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.93,0:38:44.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,the beauty you've always wanted to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.06,0:38:58.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Susan, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.44,0:39:06.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.48,0:39:20.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No! Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.71,0:39:24.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Make me she, whom I'd agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.08,0:39:35.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy. Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.64,0:39:37.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Aslan?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.77,0:39:40.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Aslan?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.38,0:39:58.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,A spell to make the unseen, seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.60,0:40:02.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Like the 'p' in psychology,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.41,0:40:05.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,the 'h' in psychiatry
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.03,0:40:08.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,invisible ink and the truth in theology.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.08,0:40:09.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Caspian, Lucy's dagger.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.14,0:40:18.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop right there or there is!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.29,0:40:25.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The spell is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.16,0:40:28.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now all is visible.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.79,0:40:53.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What sort of creatures are you? - Great ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.60,0:40:55.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,With the head of a tiger and the body of...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.47,0:40:58.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Um-different tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.28,0:41:01.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You don't want to mess with us! - Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.71,0:41:04.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Or I'll claw you to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.22,0:41:08.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll run my touch right through you!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.15,0:41:11.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I will crush you with my teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.10,0:41:13.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And I'll bite you with my fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.02,0:41:17.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You mean squash us with your fat bellies?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.34,0:41:18.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fatty bellies?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.51,0:41:20.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Or tickle us with your toes?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.11,0:41:25.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What have you done with my sister, you little pip squid?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.84,0:41:29.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Now, calm down. - Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.18,0:41:31.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Can I tell him? - Tell him, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.47,0:41:34.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- In the mansion. - What mansion?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.26,0:41:46.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh. That mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.43,0:41:48.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm getting tired of you leaving me behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.89,0:41:51.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The thing came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.34,0:41:55.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This place is weirder and weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.00,0:41:57.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's calling us weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.59,0:42:03.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.71,0:42:05.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.20,0:42:08.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Caspian and Edmund.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.41,0:42:11.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is Coriakin. It's his island.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.91,0:42:13.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's what he thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.36,0:42:15.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You have wronged us, magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.45,0:42:17.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I have not wronged you,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.56,0:42:20.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I've made you invisible for your own protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.08,0:42:21.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Protection?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.02,0:42:23.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's aggressive! Opressor!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.08,0:42:24.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I have not opressed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.26,0:42:26.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But you could have!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.02,0:42:27.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If you wanted to!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.49,0:42:29.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.83,0:42:33.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.79,0:42:36.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Loot. But don't tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.61,0:42:42.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What were those things? - Dufflepuds.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.79,0:42:44.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course. Silly me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.63,0:42:48.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What did you mean when you said
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.94,0:42:51.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,you made them invisible for their own good?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.38,0:42:53.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It seems to be the easiest way to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.99,0:42:56.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,From the evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.92,0:42:58.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You mean the mist?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.56,0:43:02.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean what lies behind the mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.00,0:43:22.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's quite beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.00,0:43:33.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean for a made belived map and a made believed world.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.36,0:43:36.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There is the source of your problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.77,0:43:40.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The Dark Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.41,0:43:43.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,A place where evil lurks.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.92,0:43:47.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It can take any form.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.26,0:43:50.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It can make your darkest dreams come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.07,0:43:54.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It seeks to corrupt all goodness
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.14,0:43:57.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Steal the lights from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.11,0:43:59.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How do we stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.95,0:44:02.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You must break its spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.01,0:44:05.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That sword you carry,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.33,0:44:07.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,there are six others.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.13,0:44:08.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Have you seen them? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.69,0:44:11.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The six lords, they passed through here?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.70,0:44:12.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.71,0:44:13.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are they heading?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.83,0:44:15.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where I've sent them.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.55,0:44:21.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Break the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.25,0:44:24.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You must follow the Blue Star...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.57,0:44:27.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,to Ramandu's Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.35,0:44:31.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There the seven swords must be laid at Aslan's table.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.80,0:44:36.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Only then can the truly magical power be released.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.15,0:44:40.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But beware.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.12,0:44:43.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You will all about to be tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.33,0:44:45.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tested?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.40,0:44:49.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Until you lay down the seventh sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.56,0:44:52.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,evil has the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.74,0:44:57.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It will do everything in it's power to tempt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.62,0:45:05.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Be strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.99,0:45:09.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't fall to temptations.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.74,0:45:13.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,To defeat the darkness out there
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.98,0:45:17.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,you must defeat the darkness inside yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.36,0:45:48.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,For reasons beyond my comprehension
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.53,0:45:51.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We have taken the advice from the senile old coup.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.19,0:45:52.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,who doesn't possess a razor,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.78,0:45:55.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and walks around on a dressing gown.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.44,0:45:57.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So we're back in the bathtub
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.95,0:46:01.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and and lost in the tempest. Brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.69,0:46:15.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,14 days of being tossed like a pancake,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.59,0:46:18.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,not the slightest sight of land.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.63,0:46:23.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The only consolation is
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.38,0:46:26.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,that everyone is finally as miserable as I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.87,0:46:31.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Except for that show-off talking rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.69,0:46:35.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He is one of the annoying glass is always half full part.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.28,0:46:42.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So, we're stuck here...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.53,0:46:44.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,with half rations,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.93,0:46:47.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,we have food and water for two more weeks maximum.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.22,0:46:52.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is your last chance to turn back, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.24,0:46:56.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There is no guarantee that we will spot the blue star anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.49,0:46:57.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Not in this storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.52,0:47:01.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Needle in a haystack trying to find this remoteness place.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.98,0:47:04.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We can sail way past and knocked to the end of world.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.56,0:47:06.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We can be eaten by a sea serpent.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.13,0:47:11.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll see when the men are getting nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.09,0:47:14.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,These are strange seas we are sailing
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.53,0:47:17.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,the lights that which i've never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.79,0:47:19.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Then perhaps captain, you'd love to be the one
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.93,0:47:21.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,to explain to Mr. Rince that we're abandoning
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.93,0:47:23.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,the search for his families?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.43,0:47:27.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll get back to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.24,0:47:32.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just a word of warning,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.25,0:47:37.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,the seas can play nasty tricks on a crew mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.77,0:47:40.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Very nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.61,0:48:14.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Transform my reflection,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.48,0:48:16.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,cast into affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.47,0:48:19.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,lashes, lips and complexion.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.34,0:48:22.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me feel whom I agree,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.28,0:48:24.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,hold more beauty over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.27,0:49:34.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ladies and Gentlemen, Ms. Pevensie.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.08,0:49:41.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.27,0:49:42.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You look beautiful, Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.08,0:49:44.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,As always.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.49,0:49:45.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.09,0:49:48.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me Miss, Can I get a photo?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.88,0:49:50.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother's gonne love this,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.60,0:49:52.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,all her children in one picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.60,0:49:54.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.10,0:49:55.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hang on. Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.61,0:49:57.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean where's Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.89,0:50:00.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy, who's Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.21,0:50:02.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Susan, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.81,0:50:05.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on now Miss. A nice big smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.98,0:50:08.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund, I'm not sure about this. I think I want to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.65,0:50:09.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go back where?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.81,0:50:11.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,To Narnia!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.88,0:50:12.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What is Narnia?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.50,0:50:14.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.63,0:50:16.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.38,0:50:24.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.76,0:50:27.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Aslan?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.12,0:50:32.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What have you done, child?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.33,0:50:38.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but that was awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.94,0:50:41.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But you chose it, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.46,0:50:44.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to choose all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.52,0:50:48.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to be as beautiful like Susan.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.47,0:50:50.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's all
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.96,0:50:56.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You wished yourself away, and with it, much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.19,0:50:57.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your brothers and sisters
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.43,0:50:59.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,wouldn't know Narnia without you, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.14,0:51:03.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You discovered it first, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.26,0:51:07.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.97,0:51:13.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You doubt your value, don't run from who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.57,0:51:16.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Aslan!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.29,0:52:11.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Father. Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.19,0:52:15.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund. Edmund.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.06,0:52:21.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come with me. Join me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.70,0:52:26.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.90,0:52:31.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.88,0:52:37.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.09,0:52:40.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me guess. Bad dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.82,0:52:43.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So either we're all going mad,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.80,0:52:47.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,or something is playing with our minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.28,0:53:11.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I doubt the Lords stopped here, my liege.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.60,0:53:13.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There is no sign of anything living.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.86,0:53:15.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Right. Well, once you have got on shore,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.58,0:53:18.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,take your men for food and water.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.43,0:53:20.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The three of us will look for clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.33,0:53:21.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hang on, You mean the four of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.38,0:53:26.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, please don't send me back to the rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.64,0:53:28.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I heard that!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.49,0:53:31.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Big ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.53,0:53:33.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I heard that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.44,0:53:53.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look. We not the first on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.79,0:53:54.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The Lords?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.36,0:53:56.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.78,0:54:03.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you think could be down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.69,0:54:05.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.89,0:54:44.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.46,0:54:48.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Looks like some kind of a gold statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.43,0:55:21.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He must have fallen in.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.70,0:55:23.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Poor man.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.78,0:55:25.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You mean, poor Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.93,0:55:27.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The crust of Lord rest in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.48,0:55:28.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And his sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.83,0:55:30.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.20,0:55:34.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.48,0:55:41.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your sword hasn't turn to gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.14,0:55:43.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Both swords are magical.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.50,0:55:50.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He mustn't have known what hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.14,0:55:55.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe, or maybe He was onto something.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.84,0:55:58.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.89,0:56:19.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you staring at?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.53,0:56:23.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoever has access to this pool,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.51,0:56:28.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,could be the most powerful person in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.78,0:56:35.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy, we'll be so rich
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.17,0:56:37.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,no one can tell us what to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.14,0:56:39.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,or who to live with.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.14,0:56:42.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't take anything out of Narnia, Edmund.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.05,0:56:43.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Says who?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.44,0:56:45.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.27,0:56:54.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I am not your subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.58,0:56:57.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You have been waiting for this, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.71,0:56:59.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,To challenge me. You doubt my leadership!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.71,0:57:01.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You doubt yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.11,0:57:02.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.00,0:57:03.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And you're a spineless sap.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.47,0:57:04.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.22,0:57:06.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of playing second fiddle...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.37,0:57:08.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,First it was Peter, and now it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.86,0:57:11.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You know I am braver than both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.13,0:57:13.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why did you get Peter's sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.63,0:57:15.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I deserve a kingdom of my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.63,0:57:17.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I deserve to rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.35,0:57:19.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If you think you're so brave...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.38,0:57:20.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,prove it!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.75,0:57:25.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.10,0:57:30.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Both of you. Look at yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.17,0:57:33.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Can't you see what's happenning?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.85,0:57:36.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This place has tempted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.00,0:57:38.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It is bewitching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.37,0:57:41.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is exactly what Coriakin is talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.31,0:57:44.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's just get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.52,0:58:09.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, follow the imaginary blue star,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.94,0:58:12.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,to the island of Rabandoedoe...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.63,0:58:17.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Like the seven steak knives on the table of a talking lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.47,0:58:20.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.04,0:58:32.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.09,0:58:47.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I must be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.75,0:59:16.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You are definitely dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.00,0:59:24.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't be needing that one wont you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.12,0:59:44.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Finally, a favorable turn of events.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.33,0:59:55.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What foods did you found?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.11,1:00:01.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It is volcanic, My majesty. Not much grows.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.40,1:00:03.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where is Eustace?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.72,1:00:09.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I believe he's out not helping us loading the boats.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.06,1:00:12.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Eustace!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.84,1:00:18.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I have got a bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.43,1:00:19.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going to find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.52,1:00:21.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll come with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.68,1:00:36.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Eustace?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.64,1:00:42.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Treasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.99,1:00:46.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.09,1:00:57.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Eustace's.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.50,1:01:03.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.37,1:01:13.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.34,1:01:15.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He was just a boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.61,1:01:19.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I never should have left him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.92,1:01:25.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What could have happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.74,1:01:29.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,In this place? Anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.65,1:01:32.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And he wasn't the first.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.08,1:01:36.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's Lord Octesian.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.98,1:01:45.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We should find this... sword.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.97,1:02:05.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.59,1:02:11.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is it the volcano?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.70,1:02:18.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh no, that's not a volcano. All hands on deck.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.32,1:02:25.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Archers, arm yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.87,1:02:47.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Take your positions and wait for my command.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.79,1:02:56.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What is it doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.82,1:02:57.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.50,1:03:04.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He will break the mast.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.04,1:03:10.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.28,1:03:14.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold your positions.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.48,1:03:17.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.06,1:03:48.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.52,1:03:54.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.08,1:03:56.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.28,1:04:25.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You've got to be joking!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.27,1:04:38.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He must have been tempted by the treasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.42,1:04:42.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows that the dragon's treasure is enchanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.48,1:04:45.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, anyone from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.64,1:05:02.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is there any way to change him back?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.47,1:05:03.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Not that I know of.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.99,1:05:09.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Aunt Alberta will not be pleased.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.61,1:05:12.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry about the hand, oh boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.42,1:05:15.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I can be a little over zealous sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.51,1:05:17.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The boats are ready, sire.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.67,1:05:18.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We can not leave him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.94,1:05:21.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, we can't bring him on board, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.65,1:05:23.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You and others take one boat back.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.67,1:05:25.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The rest of us stay here until morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.67,1:05:27.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and work out what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.30,1:05:28.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But you have no provisions.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.79,1:05:31.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And no means of staying warm, My Majesty
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.30,1:05:36.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And you were saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.56,1:05:47.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I've never seen these constellation before.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.09,1:05:50.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.35,1:05:54.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We are long way from home.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.18,1:05:58.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,When I was a boy I used to imagine sailing to the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.04,1:06:02.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,To find my father there.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.32,1:06:06.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe you will.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.95,1:06:22.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I miss my mommy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.37,1:06:29.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I miss mine too.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.77,1:06:31.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you'll see her again.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.50,1:06:33.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.61,1:06:36.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You just have to have faith about these things.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.88,1:06:38.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Aslan will help us.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.47,1:06:48.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But Aslan could have stop her from being taken.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.47,1:06:52.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll find her, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.66,1:06:54.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Somehow.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.69,1:07:23.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Trouble sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.77,1:07:29.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now now, all is not lost as it seems.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.27,1:07:33.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll stay up with you if you wish. To keep you company.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.58,1:07:39.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You didn't even believe in dragons this morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.47,1:07:48.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, extraordinary things only happen to extraordinary people.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.16,1:07:52.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a sign!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.76,1:07:55.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That you've got an extraordinary destiny
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.72,1:08:00.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Something greater than you could have imagine.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.47,1:08:04.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I can tell you
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.59,1:08:06.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,one or two of my adventures if you like,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.89,1:08:08.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,just past the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.36,1:08:11.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.07,1:08:13.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,you are not the first dragon I've encountered.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.07,1:08:16.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Many years ago, too many that I care to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.06,1:08:17.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was with a band of pirates
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.51,1:08:19.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and I met another dragon.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.21,1:08:20.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Much fierce than you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.65,1:08:35.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.34,1:08:37.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.74,1:08:40.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The Blue Star.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.09,1:08:43.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Everybody. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.57,1:08:46.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody, wake up. It is the blue star.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.38,1:08:48.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, budy, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.24,1:09:27.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Pull.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.25,1:09:32.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Put your strokes in there, lads! Pull!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.75,1:09:35.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The wind has left.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.95,1:09:38.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So how do we get to Ramandu Island now then?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.79,1:09:42.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My guess is something doesn't want us to get there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.18,1:09:45.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Pull.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.14,1:09:51.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If I'm getting hungrier, I'm gonna eat that dragon!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.08,1:09:56.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Eustace, they will to deal with me first.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.05,1:09:59.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If we don't get to landfall by tonight,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.15,1:10:01.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,they might as well eat that...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.04,1:10:08.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are we hitting?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.73,1:10:15.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Eustace, that's brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.53,1:10:24.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,En route!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.88,1:10:47.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We can't be sure that
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.45,1:10:49.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,the other Lords even made it to Ramandu's Island.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.20,1:11:02.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You got us there!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.61,1:11:07.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you? Eustace, you're extraordinary!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.89,1:12:03.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.83,1:12:41.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lord Revilian.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.22,1:12:47.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lord Mavramorn.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.03,1:12:53.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lord Argoz.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.64,1:13:03.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's breathing!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.57,1:13:11.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So are they.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.28,1:13:16.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They're under the spell.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.74,1:13:19.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's the food!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.53,1:13:26.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's the stone knife. This is Aslan's table!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.95,1:13:28.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The swords.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.46,1:13:38.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.26,1:13:49.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's six.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.50,1:13:53.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We're missing one.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.98,1:13:59.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.12,1:14:27.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Travellers of Narnia
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.20,1:14:29.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.59,1:14:33.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Arise!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.99,1:14:37.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you not hungry?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.19,1:14:39.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.21,1:14:40.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I am Lilliandil.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.45,1:14:43.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Daughter of Ramandu.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.63,1:14:45.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I am your guide.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.18,1:14:50.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're a star.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.71,1:14:59.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're most beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.10,1:15:02.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If it is a distraction for you,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.22,1:15:04.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I can change forms. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.35,1:15:07.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.40,1:15:11.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The food is for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.89,1:15:14.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There is enough for all
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.28,1:15:15.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,who are welcome at Aslan's table.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.75,1:15:19.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Always. Help yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.21,1:15:22.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.86,1:15:24.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.07,1:15:29.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,These poor men were half mad by the time they reached our shores.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.35,1:15:31.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They threatened each other with violence.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.59,1:15:34.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Violence is forbidden at the table of Aslan.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.94,1:15:37.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So they were sent to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.32,1:15:38.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Will they ever awake?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.59,1:15:41.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,When all is put right.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.66,1:15:44.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come. There is little time.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.58,1:16:04.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The Magician Coriakin told you of Dark Island?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.02,1:16:07.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.03,1:16:14.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,For long the evil will be unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.72,1:16:17.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Coriakin said, to break the spell,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.10,1:16:19.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,we need the seventh sword on the Aslan's table.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.94,1:16:23.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- He speaks the truth. - But we found only six.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.75,1:16:25.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you know where the seventh is?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.98,1:16:28.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,In there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.96,1:16:31.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You will need great courage.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.03,1:16:39.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, don't waste your time.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.58,1:16:43.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How we meet again?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.94,1:16:47.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.16,1:17:16.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So what do you think it's in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.63,1:17:18.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Our worst nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.78,1:17:21.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Our darkest wishes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.69,1:17:24.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Pure evil.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.85,1:17:30.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tavros, unlock the armory
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.61,1:17:31.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.65,1:17:35.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Archers, prepare yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.58,1:17:37.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Dock the lanterns.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.25,1:17:39.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's get ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.65,1:17:49.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,When I grow up, I want to be just like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.83,1:17:58.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,When you grow up,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.34,1:18:03.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,you should be just like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.69,1:18:14.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If case we don't get through,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.98,1:18:16.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,whatever this is...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.66,1:18:19.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I want you to know I think of you as my brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.70,1:18:21.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.45,1:18:28.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You gave up your sword.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.91,1:18:31.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It was not mine to keep.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.78,1:18:36.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Use this.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.82,1:18:39.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But it is...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.80,1:18:41.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter would like you to have it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.82,1:18:53.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Here it is, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.17,1:18:55.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The battle awaits.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.50,1:18:58.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Eustace, no. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.19,1:19:00.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Eustace, stop
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.21,1:19:01.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.25,1:19:05.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I will not accept surrender.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.62,1:19:08.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,A true warrior does not flight out of fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.00,1:19:11.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at me when I'm talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.39,1:19:18.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm a mouse. You a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.97,1:19:22.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You have a skin like leather. You breathe fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.76,1:19:25.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's meet our destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.73,1:19:34.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.34,1:19:36.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,every soul standing before me,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.78,1:19:40.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,has earned a place on the Dawn Treader.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.95,1:19:42.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Together we traveled far.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.64,1:19:46.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Together, we have faced diversity. Together...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.62,1:19:48.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,we can do it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.61,1:19:50.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So now is not the time
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.55,1:19:53.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,to fall in fears and temptations. Be strong!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.82,1:19:54.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Never give in.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.32,1:19:57.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Our world,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.73,1:20:00.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,our Narnian lives depend on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.64,1:20:03.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Think of the lost souls we are here to save.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.13,1:20:09.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Think of Aslan.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.26,1:20:14.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Think of Narnia. - For Narnia!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.52,1:20:19.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,For Narnia!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.59,1:21:16.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Helene?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.43,1:21:29.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We can't see a thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.77,1:21:31.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The fog is too thick.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.14,1:21:40.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're a great disappointment to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.41,1:21:43.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You call yourself my son?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.13,1:21:45.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And act like a king.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.74,1:21:50.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.38,1:21:53.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.79,1:21:56.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Be my king.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.06,1:22:01.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I let you rule. - Go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.75,1:22:02.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.90,1:22:04.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You can never kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.82,1:22:11.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I will always be alive in your mind, silly boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.06,1:22:13.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- No! - Edmund?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.61,1:22:16.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.14,1:22:19.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.83,1:22:31.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Keep away!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.70,1:22:34.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Keep away!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.28,1:22:36.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.88,1:22:40.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Will we not fear you! - Not, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.26,1:22:53.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Keep away! - We do not leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.32,1:22:56.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You will not defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.76,1:22:57.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Caspian
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.64,1:22:59.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Caspian, the sword!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.66,1:23:02.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lord Rhoop.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.99,1:23:07.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You cannot own me!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.24,1:23:09.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.54,1:23:10.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's get him onboard, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.08,1:23:22.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Be calm my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.63,1:23:24.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Off me, demons!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.75,1:23:25.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, my Lord
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.15,1:23:29.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We're not here to hurt you. I am your king.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.82,1:23:30.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Caspian.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.09,1:23:38.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.01,1:23:43.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You should not have come. There is no way out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.38,1:23:46.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Quickly turn this ship about before it is too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.12,1:23:48.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We have the sword. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.70,1:23:50.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's turn this ship around.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.15,1:23:51.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All on you, my majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.98,1:23:53.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do not think.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.16,1:23:56.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do not let it know your fears,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.41,1:23:58.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,or it will become them!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.25,1:24:02.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh no. - Edmund.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.19,1:24:06.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What did you just think of? - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.41,1:24:22.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.82,1:24:23.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.40,1:24:26.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's too late!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.51,1:24:28.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's too late!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.10,1:24:33.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get on the boat. Just get on the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.41,1:24:34.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Gael.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.78,1:24:45.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come, walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.01,1:24:50.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't let me down. No fear. No retreats.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.87,1:25:03.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,For Narnia! Take that.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.55,1:25:06.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And that.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.86,1:25:08.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Eustace, hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.80,1:25:40.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'll kill it. - No, the sword!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.27,1:25:41.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The sword!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.10,1:25:42.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Eustace!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.82,1:25:44.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.45,1:25:47.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We are doomed. Doomed!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.62,1:25:49.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Turn this ship about. - Stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.58,1:25:51.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.55,1:26:01.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Rowers. To your rowing position.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.35,1:26:07.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Forward at double speed. - Aslan, please help us.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.52,1:26:15.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Pull.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.05,1:26:18.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Pull!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.04,1:26:39.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Pull!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.76,1:26:48.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.18,1:27:03.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You must stay here until someone comes and get you!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.41,1:27:10.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ed!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.37,1:27:14.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ed! We run the serpent, smash him on the rocks.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.47,1:27:17.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay on the port, I will keep it on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.73,1:27:20.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.53,1:27:25.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Pull!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.73,1:27:27.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Pull!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.35,1:27:37.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Try to kill me, come on! Come on here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.53,1:27:43.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- No! - Edmund.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.81,1:28:02.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.56,1:28:12.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Brace yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.38,1:29:27.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.75,1:29:44.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We can beat this.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.96,1:30:05.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- We must get closer. - Everybody to the main deck.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.76,1:30:07.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ready the hard lance.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.20,1:30:14.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I want everyone here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.86,1:30:20.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.70,1:30:22.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,now!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.63,1:30:30.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Put his head down!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.12,1:30:53.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Heave!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.95,1:31:02.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.24,1:31:11.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to prove, Edmund?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.27,1:31:13.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That you are a man?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.35,1:31:25.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.98,1:31:27.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I can make you that.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.53,1:31:29.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I can make you my king.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.98,1:31:33.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just take my hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.71,1:31:49.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just give it here.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.31,1:32:00.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.97,1:32:02.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.92,1:32:09.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.56,1:32:44.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The spell, it has lifted.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.77,1:32:49.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.22,1:32:53.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Caspian, Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.80,1:33:24.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Narnians!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.08,1:33:25.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Narnians!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.03,1:33:43.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Mommy! - Helene.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.54,1:33:55.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Rince, Gael.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.14,1:33:56.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.99,1:34:02.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.07,1:34:10.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's have them onboard, clear the decks.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.63,1:34:17.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We did it, I knew we would.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.60,1:34:21.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- It wasn't just us. - You mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.49,1:34:24.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm here, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.52,1:34:25.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.82,1:34:28.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Here, Lucy. I'm in the water. Lucy
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.37,1:34:29.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Eustace!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.76,1:34:32.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I am a boy again. I am a boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.98,1:34:36.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Eustace! I see your wings have been clipped.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.77,1:34:44.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where sky and water meet. Where the waves grow ever sweet.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.12,1:34:46.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's sweet!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.42,1:34:47.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's sweet!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.97,1:34:50.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.29,1:34:52.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.07,1:35:00.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Aslan's country.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.68,1:35:02.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We must have be close.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.88,1:35:06.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, we've come so far.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.47,1:35:21.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So what was it like? When Aslan changed you back?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.92,1:35:26.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard I tried, I just couldn't do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.67,1:35:30.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Then he came towards me. It was sort of hurt, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.16,1:35:32.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It was good pay.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.24,1:35:36.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Like when you pull a sword from your foot.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.88,1:35:39.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Being a dragon wasn't all bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.02,1:35:43.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean I was a better dragon than a boy, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.59,1:35:46.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for being such a sob.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.85,1:35:50.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's okay Eustace. You were a pretty good dragon.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.04,1:35:58.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My friends, we've arrived
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.90,1:36:36.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Aslan.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.18,1:36:41.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome, children. You have done well.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.40,1:36:42.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Very well indeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.28,1:36:44.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You have come far.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.50,1:36:47.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now your journey is at it's end.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.36,1:36:50.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is this your country?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.28,1:36:52.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, my country lies beyond.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.06,1:36:57.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is my father in your country?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.86,1:37:01.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You can only find that out on yourself, my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.61,1:37:05.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But you should know that if you continue, there is no return.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.76,1:37:39.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You not going?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.25,1:37:41.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Can't imagine my father would be very proud
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.37,1:37:44.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,that I gave up what he died for.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.34,1:37:48.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I spent too long wanting what
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.50,1:37:50.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,have been taken from me but not what was given.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.34,1:37:53.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was given a kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.62,1:37:56.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,People.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.16,1:38:05.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I promise to be a better king.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.60,1:38:07.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You already are.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.87,1:38:09.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Children.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.17,1:38:13.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I think perhaps it's time we went home actually then?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.52,1:38:19.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I thought you loved it here? - I do!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.12,1:38:23.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But I love home and our family as well!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.17,1:38:27.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They need us.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.94,1:38:39.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your eminence, ever since I can remember,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.06,1:38:41.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I've dreamt of seeing your country
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.04,1:38:44.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I have had many great adventures in this world,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.57,1:38:48.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but nothing has dampen that yearning.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.31,1:38:51.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I know I'm hardly worthy, but with your permission...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.23,1:38:54.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd lay down my sword for the joy of
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.89,1:38:58.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,seeing your country with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.62,1:39:06.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My country was made for noble hearts such as yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.11,1:39:09.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No matter how small that can be.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.20,1:39:13.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Your majesty. - Nobody deserves it more.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.24,1:39:14.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.58,1:39:30.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,May I?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.54,1:39:34.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose...just this..
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.63,1:39:40.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.89,1:39:57.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.10,1:40:00.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.37,1:40:06.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,When will I see you again?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.02,1:40:09.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What a magnificent puzzle you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.96,1:40:11.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And a true hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.56,1:40:14.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It has been my honor to fight beside
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.02,1:40:15.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,such a brave warrior.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.62,1:40:16.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And a great friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.71,1:40:31.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I won't be needing this.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.40,1:41:01.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is our last time here, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.60,1:41:02.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.90,1:41:05.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You have grown up, my dear one.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.26,1:41:08.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just like Peter and Susan.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.77,1:41:10.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Will you visit us in our world?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.63,1:41:14.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I shall be watching you always.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.18,1:41:19.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- How? - In your world...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.11,1:41:24.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I have another name. You must learn to know me by it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.08,1:41:27.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That was the very reason you were brought to Narnia.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.19,1:41:30.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That by knowing me here for a little,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.07,1:41:33.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll know me better there.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.32,1:41:35.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Will we meet again?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.27,1:41:40.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, dear one. One day.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.63,1:41:57.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You are closest to me I have as family.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.30,1:42:02.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And that includes you, Eustace.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.50,1:42:05.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.22,1:42:35.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Will I come back?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.92,1:42:38.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Narnia may yet of need of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.67,1:43:36.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Eustace!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.14,1:43:42.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Eustace! What are you doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.80,1:43:45.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jill drops in for a visit.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.61,1:43:59.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We spoke often of Narnia in the days that follow.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.23,1:44:03.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And when all my cousins have left.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.93,1:44:06.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,After the war ended...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.69,1:44:10.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I missed them with all my heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.41,1:44:14.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,As I know all Narnians will miss them
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.93,1:44:17.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Till the end of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:15.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,《纳尼亚传奇3: 黎明踏浪号》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.86,0:01:20.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(祖国需要你 来参军吧)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.57,0:01:28.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你真的是十八岁吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.86,0:01:30.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了,我看上去更老吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.46,0:01:38.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(艾伯塔)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.53,0:01:42.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 艾伯塔·斯卡布  - 写错了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.78,0:01:45.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,应该是艾伯特·A·斯卡布
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.41,0:01:46.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.96,0:01:49.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,说好陪我去杂货店的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.81,0:01:55.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小朋友,下次好运
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.11,0:02:05.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小朋友,他顶多比我大两岁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.02,0:02:10.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我可是国王,带过兵打过仗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.82,0:02:12.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不是在这个世界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.25,0:02:14.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,我现在反而被困在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.89,0:02:17.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,和尤斯提·克劳伦斯·斯卡布吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.97,0:02:19.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.97,0:02:19.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他可真是名不符实
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.59,0:02:23.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.21,0:02:27.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没事,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.75,0:02:35.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.46,0:02:36.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的日记
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.37,0:02:39.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我万恶的表哥埃德蒙和表姐露西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.30,0:02:42.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,入侵我们家已经有二百五十三天了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.50,0:02:44.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道我还能撑多久
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.96,0:02:46.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想和他们分享我的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.52,0:02:50.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,要是对待亲戚能像对昆虫一样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.21,0:02:52.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那所有的麻烦都解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.39,0:02:55.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,直接把他们关在罐子里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.76,0:02:58.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 或钉在墙上  - 我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.04,0:02:59.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.94,0:03:01.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小贴士
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.98,0:03:05.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,查找刺穿亲戚的法律后果
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.46,0:03:11.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,最后是西线战事新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.27,0:03:12.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,哈罗德姨父好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.70,0:03:13.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我本想买点胡萝卜的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.95,0:03:15.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但又只有白萝卜了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.43,0:03:17.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在煲汤吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.46,0:03:19.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,艾伯塔姨妈在回来路上了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:26.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 哈罗德姨父  - 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.02,0:03:28.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙在对你做鬼脸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.51,0:03:31.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你这个小坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:32.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸,他要来打我了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.06,0:03:35.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙快看,苏珊来信了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.77,0:03:38.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真希望你们也在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.08,0:03:39.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这儿的生活真像冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.27,0:03:42.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但比不上纳尼亚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.05,0:03:44.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,美国真令人兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.16,0:03:48.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,除了总看不到老爸这点,他工作太忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.99,0:03:50.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一位海军长官邀请我这周参加
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.49,0:03:53.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,英国领事馆的茶话会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.35,0:03:57.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他很帅,我觉得他喜欢我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.57,0:03:59.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,德国似乎现在
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.67,0:04:01.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,战况急转直下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.85,0:04:02.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,时局动荡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:04.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,母亲希望你们不介意
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:05.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在剑桥多待几个月
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.49,0:04:10.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,再待几个月,我们怎么熬得下去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.08,0:04:13.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你幸运多了,起码你有自己的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:15.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我和那个讨厌鬼住一起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.32,0:04:17.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,苏珊和彼德才幸运
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.14,0:04:20.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 又开始历险了  - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.86,0:04:22.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谁让他们比我们大呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.64,0:04:25.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别计较太多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.23,0:04:28.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得我哪儿长得像苏珊吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:33.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西,你之前看过这船吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.36,0:04:37.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是的,很有纳尼亚的风格是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.29,0:04:42.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是的,又在提醒我们这里不是纳尼亚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.05,0:04:46.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,从前有两个孤儿总浪费时间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.78,0:04:48.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,相信着纳尼亚童谣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.99,0:04:50.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 让我揍他吧  - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:52.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你不会敲门吗  - 这是我家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.71,0:04:53.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想干什么就干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.79,0:04:54.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们只是客人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.48,0:04:58.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这幅画有什么吸引人的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.81,0:04:59.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,丑死了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.19,0:05:02.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,局外人是看不懂的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.31,0:05:06.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙快看,水好像真的在动
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.31,0:05:07.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,净说瞎话,看到没
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.23,0:05:08.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是魔幻小说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.54,0:05:11.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,和童话看多了的结果
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.63,0:05:13.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,从前有个男孩叫尤斯提
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.47,0:05:15.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看的书里净是些毫无用处的事实
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.45,0:05:18.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那些看童话的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.60,0:05:21.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,总会成为像我这类人的可怕负担
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.25,0:05:22.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我看书是为了追求真理
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.94,0:05:24.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可怕的负担
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.27,0:05:27.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,打我们搬来就没见你做过什么家务
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.43,0:05:30.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,要不要我去告诉你爸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.58,0:05:32.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是你偷了艾伯塔姨妈的糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:34.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你说谎  - 是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.38,0:05:35.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙,看这画
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:37.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我在你床底下发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:40.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,而且我每一个都舔过了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.83,0:05:42.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我会被你传染的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.49,0:05:50.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是怎么了  - 露西,你觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.47,0:05:51.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们在耍鬼把戏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.35,0:05:52.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快停下来不然我告诉我妈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:05:55.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.89,0:05:59.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要把这烂东西撕掉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.31,0:06:02.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,尤斯提,别
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.04,0:06:02.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们阻止不了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.11,0:06:03.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,放开我,放开
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.98,0:06:05.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,放手,尤斯提
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.18,0:06:07.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把画放下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.32,0:06:08.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,放手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.53,0:06:37.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.91,0:06:48.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 尤斯提,快游  - 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.21,0:06:51.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快躲开
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.43,0:06:53.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一直游
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:05.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没事了,你安全了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.15,0:07:09.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 凯斯宾  - 露西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.74,0:07:11.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙,是凯斯宾
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.19,0:07:13.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没事了孩子们,你们现在安全了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.01,0:07:14.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这儿是纳尼亚吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.93,0:07:16.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是的,这里是纳尼亚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.94,0:07:20.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想走,我要回英国
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.30,0:07:21.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要回英国
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.56,0:07:23.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抓好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.20,0:07:45.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,太惊险了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:47.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们怎么在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.93,0:07:49.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.56,0:07:50.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,凯斯宾
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.24,0:07:53.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.35,0:07:54.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,见到你真高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.38,0:07:55.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:56.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你召唤我们了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.89,0:07:58.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没有,这次没有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.78,0:08:02.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不管怎样,我都很高兴回来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.61,0:08:08.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 镇定  - 把这东西弄走
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.53,0:08:13.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,雷佩契普
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.97,0:08:17.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 陛下  - 你好,雷佩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.79,0:08:20.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 很荣幸  - 应该是我深感荣幸,阁下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.76,0:08:23.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但首先,这个歇斯底里的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.64,0:08:25.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,闯入者该怎么处置
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.38,0:08:28.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那个大老鼠刚才想抓我的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.60,0:08:32.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是想帮你把水从肺里挤出来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.44,0:08:35.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他说话,看到了吗,刚有人听见吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.23,0:08:36.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 它刚说话了  - 他总说话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.02,0:08:39.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,让他不说话才需要点魔法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.06,0:08:41.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,陛下,在不需要说话的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.34,0:08:43.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我保证我一句话不说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.55,0:08:45.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真不知道这是什么恶作剧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.66,0:08:47.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但我想立马醒来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.06,0:08:49.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,也许我们可以把他扔回去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.13,0:08:53.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.64,0:08:57.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快告诉我,我现在到底在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:09:01.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是黎明踏浪号,纳尼亚海军最棒的船
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.65,0:09:09.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是因为我说了什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:12.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 照顾下他行吗  - 是,陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.10,0:09:17.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,将士们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.21,0:09:20.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看看我们刚救上来的人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.29,0:09:25.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,公正王埃德蒙和勇气女王露西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.28,0:09:28.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,纳尼亚的国王和女王万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.28,0:09:59.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.97,0:10:10.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看,苏珊的弓和箭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.77,0:10:11.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.49,0:10:16.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我的神药和短剑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.86,0:10:20.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 给我了吗  - 当然,这是你的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.65,0:10:22.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 彼德的剑  - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.64,0:10:25.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我答应过代为保管的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.07,0:10:29.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,给,想要的话拿着
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.62,0:10:33.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不,这是你的,彼德给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.53,0:10:37.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我还帮你留着这个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.54,0:10:43.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.93,0:10:47.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们走后,北方的巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.09,0:10:48.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,无条件投降了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.89,0:10:51.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们打败了大沙漠的卡罗门军队
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.02,0:10:54.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 纳尼亚现在一派和平景象  - 和平吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.25,0:10:56.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这三年
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.25,0:10:59.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那这三年你有为自己找个王后吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.77,0:11:04.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没有,都比不上你姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.07,0:11:05.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,现在没有战争
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.67,0:11:07.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,也没人有麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.08,0:11:09.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那我们为什么会来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.37,0:11:10.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,问得好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.61,0:11:12.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我也在想这个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.75,0:11:13.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们这次要去哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.35,0:11:16.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,从我皇叔那儿夺回王位
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.67,0:11:17.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他曾想杀掉我父亲最亲近的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:19.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,同时也是最忠实的支持者
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.85,0:11:22.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,台尔玛七勋爵
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.14,0:11:28.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们逃到了寂岛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.13,0:11:31.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,从此再无音讯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.56,0:11:35.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得他们已遭不测
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.53,0:11:39.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果真是这样,我有责任查清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:43.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,寂岛东边是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.21,0:11:45.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:47.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,未知海域,难以想象之地
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.80,0:11:51.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,传说有海蛇或更恐怖的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.64,0:11:54.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,海蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.79,0:11:57.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,行了船长,你的无稽之谈到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.20,0:12:14.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,水天相接之地,海浪甜蜜翻涌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.47,0:12:18.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要怀疑,雷佩契普
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.96,0:12:24.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,极东之外,你能找到追寻之物
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.22,0:12:25.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要怀疑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.40,0:12:27.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 真好听  - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.16,0:12:31.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我小时候,林中仙女唱给我听的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.45,0:12:36.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不明白什么意思,但歌词永生难忘
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.19,0:12:38.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,雷佩,你觉得过了寂岛是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.05,0:12:40.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别人告诉我,航行到最东边
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.87,0:12:42.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是世界尽头
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.34,0:12:44.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰的国家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.41,0:12:46.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你真相信有这么个地方吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.73,0:12:49.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果什么都不信我们将一无所有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.28,0:12:54.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那你觉得我们能航行到那儿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.63,0:12:57.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只有一个办法能弄明白
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.61,0:13:00.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,希望我能有这个机会亲眼目睹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.51,0:13:02.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.85,0:14:04.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,朋友,你变强壮了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.11,0:14:06.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我感觉也是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.86,0:14:10.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,回去工作
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:14.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 殿下  - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.01,0:14:21.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙,你觉得如果我们一直航行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.63,0:14:22.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,直到世界尽头
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.53,0:14:26.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不会从边上掉下去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.49,0:14:29.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心,小露,我们离那儿还远着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.23,0:14:31.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们俩又在说些没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.61,0:14:34.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,感觉好点了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.53,0:14:36.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是的,但不是因为你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.54,0:14:38.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,多亏我有钢铁般的体魄
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.57,0:14:40.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我看你还是一样活力四射嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.58,0:14:42.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不晕船了吗  - 从没晕过
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.91,0:14:44.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只是有点受惊吓而已
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.18,0:14:48.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我妈说我洞察力强,因为高智商
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.35,0:14:51.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得你毫无洞察力可言
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.66,0:14:53.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,到了文明社会你们就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.99,0:14:55.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我会联系英国大使馆
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.39,0:14:57.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,告你们绑架,全抓起来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.79,0:14:59.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,绑架是吗,真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.36,0:15:01.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我们救了你的小命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.84,0:15:03.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们强行把我扣留在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.96,0:15:04.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.74,0:15:07.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,让我住脏透了的地下室
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.33,0:15:08.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那儿就像个动物园
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.17,0:15:12.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他可真爱抱怨  - 这还只是热身
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.96,0:15:14.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看到陆地啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.70,0:15:40.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,寂岛,去往东方圣境的入口
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.22,0:15:43.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,奇怪,没看到纳尼亚国旗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.14,0:15:47.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,寂岛一直属于纳尼亚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:51.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,事有蹊跷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.91,0:15:55.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,准备一支先头登陆部队
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:16:00.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 垂尼安  - 抱歉,陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.37,0:16:04.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但这船的最高指挥官是凯斯宾王子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.34,0:16:07.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好吧  - 用长船
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.74,0:16:09.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,垂尼安,派几个人登岸
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.35,0:16:10.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.10,0:16:10.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,塔若斯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.83,0:16:16.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,准备长船,收帆准备抛描
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.68,0:16:35.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,前进,未知的刺激就在眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.24,0:16:37.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们就不能等到明天早上吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.33,0:16:41.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,冒险面前退缩可不好,小伙子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.68,0:16:44.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,听,人都哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.19,0:16:49.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 把手给我,哆嗦腿  - 我自己能行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.60,0:16:54.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你确定你们有血缘关系吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.26,0:17:18.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,雷佩契普
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.38,0:17:21.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,和垂尼安的人一起守在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.46,0:17:23.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们先上去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.84,0:17:25.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果明早还没回来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.11,0:17:28.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 再派人  - 是,陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.72,0:17:44.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好像这儿没人住
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.99,0:17:46.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们还是走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.98,0:17:52.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你想过来保护什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:56.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好的,好主意,表哥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.93,0:17:59.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,非常有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.45,0:18:11.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,交给我,交给我,不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.78,0:18:33.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,需要时尽管叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.77,0:18:45.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这些人是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.82,0:18:47.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么他们的名字被划了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.14,0:18:51.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有点像价目表
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.36,0:18:53.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,奴隶买卖
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.30,0:18:59.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.73,0:19:18.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,除非你们想听到这个废物
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.19,0:19:20.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,再次像女孩一样惨叫
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.95,0:19:23.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,否则就放下武器
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.44,0:19:25.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 像女孩  - 马上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.02,0:19:30.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 放下  - 尤斯提
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.79,0:19:34.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 把他们铐起来  - 你过来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.98,0:19:35.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.18,0:19:38.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把这两个带去集市
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.36,0:19:38.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.87,0:19:40.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,另外两个关到地牢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.12,0:19:44.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,听着,无礼的蠢货,我是你们的国王
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.91,0:19:48.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你们会付出代价的  - 事实上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.55,0:19:51.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,付代价的另有其人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.81,0:19:55.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们都会被拍卖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.59,0:19:57.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不,埃德蒙  - 露西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.14,0:20:13.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗  - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.25,0:20:23.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没用的,你们出不去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.57,0:20:27.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是谁  - 没人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.79,0:20:29.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只是我脑中回荡的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.22,0:20:42.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,伯恩勋爵
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.64,0:20:50.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那是以前的我,现在配不上这称号了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:53.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他是七勋爵之一吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.23,0:21:05.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你的脸,让我想起我认识的一个国王
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.57,0:21:08.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那是我父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.17,0:21:12.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我的老天,请宽恕我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.59,0:21:14.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别,请起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.63,0:21:19.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.73,0:21:20.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,赫兰
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.91,0:21:21.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.54,0:21:29.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.47,0:21:31.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.73,0:21:32.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,滚回去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.05,0:21:35.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.38,0:21:36.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,跟爸爸在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.53,0:21:38.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心,我会找到你的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.52,0:21:40.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.60,0:21:56.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他们要被带去哪儿  - 继续看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.40,0:22:29.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了  - 这是祭品
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.02,0:22:33.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他们去哪了  - 没人知道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.85,0:22:37.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这雾最早出现在东方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.99,0:22:41.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,然后就传出渔民和水手出海失踪的消息
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.98,0:22:44.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,所以我们几个勋爵约定
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.37,0:22:47.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,找到绿雾的源头并消灭掉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.35,0:22:48.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们分头起航
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.88,0:22:51.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但没人回来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.59,0:22:59.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果他们不把你卖给奴隶贩子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.47,0:23:02.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,很可能会让你喂绿雾
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.74,0:23:04.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要尽快找到露西
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.13,0:23:06.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不然就来不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.42,0:23:08.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我出六十  - 我出八十
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.58,0:23:10.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我出一百买那个小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.42,0:23:13.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 一百二  - 我出一百五
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:15.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还有出价更高的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.62,0:23:18.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(已成交)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.75,0:23:20.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,成交
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.51,0:23:23.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快走,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.34,0:23:24.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.34,0:23:28.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,大家看看,这可是上等货
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.51,0:23:30.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谁先出价啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.28,0:23:34.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,各位,他可能看起来不怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.81,0:23:36.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可是他身强力壮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.76,0:23:38.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,他长得是挺结实的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.10,0:23:41.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,闻起来跟牛头人身怪的屁股一样臭
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.14,0:23:43.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.01,0:23:46.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我连续两年获得了学校的"讲卫生"奖
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.28,0:23:50.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧,大家出价吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.41,0:23:52.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这家伙我要了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.38,0:23:54.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你的人我全都要了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.98,0:23:56.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为纳尼亚而战
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.98,0:24:20.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢,雷佩,我知道你会来救我的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.91,0:24:21.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为您效劳,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.50,0:24:30.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拿钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.43,0:24:39.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,钥匙,接着
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.87,0:25:17.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你可是魔法大陆的船
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.53,0:25:19.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你就不能自己动吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.65,0:25:41.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,希望他不是英国领事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.12,0:25:44.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,国王陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.25,0:25:46.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 陛下  - 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.09,0:25:48.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我的妻子今早上被人带走了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.08,0:25:49.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.33,0:25:51.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我求你,带我一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.33,0:25:54.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我也要去  - 不盖尔,待在婶婶身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.15,0:25:56.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是个水手
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.68,0:25:58.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一直生活在海上
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.82,0:26:01.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没问题,跟我们走吧  - 谢谢您
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.07,0:26:03.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 但是爸爸  - 要是我回不来了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.82,0:26:07.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你要乖乖地听话
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.87,0:26:14.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.87,0:26:16.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.20,0:26:22.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是您父亲给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.51,0:26:25.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这些年我把它藏在洞穴里
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.61,0:26:27.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是纳尼亚的剑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.12,0:26:29.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是黄金年代流传下来的剑
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.05,0:26:31.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一共有七把
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.12,0:26:34.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰的礼物,来保卫纳尼亚的剑
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.07,0:26:37.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你父亲把它们交给我们保管
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.37,0:26:39.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拿去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.06,0:26:45.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,愿它能保护您
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.39,0:26:56.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你,勋爵
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.30,0:26:59.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会找到其他的勋爵
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.68,0:27:04.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.25,0:27:24.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的日记,我的世界发生了巨大的变化
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.89,0:27:26.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我被我的表兄妹劫持了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.84,0:27:28.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,漂流在一片未知的海域
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.67,0:27:31.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我正在一艘外观十分可笑的船上
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.07,0:27:31.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,更糟的是
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.84,0:27:34.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,本以为和表兄妹住一起已经够恶心了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.93,0:27:38.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在竟然和讨厌的老鼠共处一室
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.26,0:27:41.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,到目前为止,我在怪地方所遇到的人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.67,0:27:44.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,都患有异常严重的弗洛伊德妄想症
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.13,0:27:48.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们寻找着绿雾和失踪的勋爵
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.00,0:27:52.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我只能把这归结于他们都营养不良
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.17,0:27:55.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,每个人都是疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.98,0:27:59.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙表哥也是
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.00,0:28:02.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他一有空就擦那把薄剑
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.59,0:28:04.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好像那是神灯一样
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.28,0:28:06.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,笨蛋必须给自己找点乐子
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.09,0:28:07.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这肯定是把好剑
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.74,0:28:09.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这种剑有小号的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.60,0:28:14.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,讨厌的玛德蒙的妄想症比我表哥的还严重
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.70,0:28:21.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在英格兰我们有捕鼠器之类的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.63,0:28:26.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,说到食物,你觉得我能搞到点吃的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.49,0:28:30.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么和那只鸟说话
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.13,0:28:33.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我以为它当然和你一样...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.22,0:28:36.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他在和鸟讲话
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.10,0:28:39.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他比那鸟还笨
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.46,0:28:43.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,走开,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.55,0:29:09.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你知不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.88,0:29:12.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,偷食物是死罪
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.45,0:29:15.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.97,0:29:18.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.07,0:29:21.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 程度不重也会被杀  - 什么罪
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.51,0:29:25.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,叛国,偷窃,还有滋扰行为
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.19,0:29:28.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把橘子交出来,这事就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.20,0:29:29.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.65,0:29:31.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,请允许我
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.34,0:29:35.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我受够你了  - 把手从我尾巴上拿开
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.68,0:29:38.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,伟大的阿斯兰赐予了我这只尾巴
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.25,0:29:42.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没有人,再强调一遍,没有人可以碰它
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.10,0:29:45.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 发言完毕,打个感叹号  - 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.42,0:29:49.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在,把橘子拿出来我就放你走
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.44,0:29:51.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别别别,求你了,我是个和平主义者
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.38,0:29:59.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 当心点  - 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.72,0:30:05.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你想逃跑吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.66,0:30:07.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可是在船上,你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.08,0:30:09.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们能不能不讨论这个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.61,0:30:12.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是罚你偷东西,这是罚你撒谎
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.45,0:30:14.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是额外的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.14,0:30:21.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就是要这气势,要决斗了,接着
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.00,0:30:25.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧,让我看看你的本事
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.82,0:30:27.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你就这点本事,上呀,小子
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.84,0:30:34.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要像醉汉似的左摇右晃
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.53,0:30:36.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,站直了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.49,0:30:38.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把腿抬高
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.96,0:30:48.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿嘿,我在这儿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.31,0:30:52.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,双脚要站住了,左脚,右脚
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.19,0:30:55.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,懂了吗,来吧,身体灵活点
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.30,0:30:56.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,击剑是门舞蹈,小子
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.68,0:30:59.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来,再来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.85,0:31:03.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.44,0:31:12.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,吃我一腿
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.13,0:31:20.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.68,0:31:26.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,盖尔,你在这儿干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.62,0:31:47.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看来我们多了位新成员
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.82,0:31:58.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 欢迎来到船上  - 女王陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.25,0:32:00.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,叫我露西就好,跟我来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.32,0:32:04.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,伙计们,回去工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.63,0:32:08.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,刚才的决斗很精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.47,0:32:10.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我会把你训练成一个剑客的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.08,0:32:14.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.05,0:32:16.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,要是在陆地上打话我会站的更稳
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.33,0:32:18.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,到时候你肯定输
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.34,0:32:21.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.88,0:32:34.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看起来这岛上没人
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.20,0:32:36.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果国王们寻着那雾到了东部
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.77,0:32:38.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们可能会停驻在此
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.74,0:32:40.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这可能是个圈套
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.70,0:32:44.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,也可能会为我们解开些谜团
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.18,0:32:45.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,凯斯宾
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.69,0:32:49.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,今晚我们在海岸歇息
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.66,0:32:51.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,大家侦查下这个岛
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.32,0:32:52.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是的,陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.24,0:33:14.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这鼾声就像猪一样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.86,0:33:22.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,选她吧,是个女的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.18,0:33:25.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她也是女的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.91,0:33:29.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她识字
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.69,0:33:32.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那就带她走
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.51,0:34:09.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是逃不掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.16,0:34:11.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们长得很可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.74,0:34:12.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.90,0:34:15.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是青面獠牙的隐形怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.38,0:34:18.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你要是能看见我们,肯定会被吓到的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.80,0:34:22.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你忘了说我们体型巨大
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.46,0:34:23.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们想怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.89,0:34:25.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,按我们说的做
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.73,0:34:26.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她会听话的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.64,0:34:28.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,说得好,简单明了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.39,0:34:32.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不然呢  - 不然就杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.47,0:34:34.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,杀了你,杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.35,0:34:38.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,杀了你,杀了你,杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.01,0:34:42.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要是死了,不就没什么用了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.92,0:34:44.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我忽略了这点
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.42,0:34:46.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对,她说得有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.98,0:34:50.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那好吧,我们就把你的朋友杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.18,0:34:55.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好主意  - 你们想要我做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.01,0:35:00.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,进入那个暴君的城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.58,0:35:03.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么城堡  - 这个
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.14,0:35:14.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,上楼之后你会发现一本咒语书
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.05,0:35:17.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,朗诵那条"使隐形的都显形"的咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.37,0:35:21.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 说的好,老大  - 说得太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.62,0:35:25.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快点,我们赶时间
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.71,0:35:27.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,记住,不照做的话你的朋友都得死
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.48,0:35:30.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是警告  - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.32,0:35:32.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.97,0:35:37.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们为什么不自己念
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.15,0:35:38.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不识字
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.62,0:35:41.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,也不会写字
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.83,0:35:44.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 就这样  - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.67,0:35:47.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们怎么不早说
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.26,0:35:52.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 小心那个暴君  - 他性情凶暴
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.53,0:35:54.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,"使隐形的都显形"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.76,0:35:57.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,记住了吗,别忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.68,0:36:14.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德,醒醒
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.47,0:36:16.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快醒醒,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.25,0:36:26.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.70,0:36:29.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.28,0:36:30.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,大家快醒醒
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.34,0:36:33.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我说快起来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.60,0:36:37.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 往这边走  - 快
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.50,0:37:22.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(咒语书)
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.69,0:37:31.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(牙痛治愈咒语)
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.60,0:37:35.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(遗忘咒语)
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.02,0:37:44.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,念了这些,你会瞠目结舌
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.91,0:37:48.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,周围漫布白雪
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.43,0:38:41.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,此咒语百发百中
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.93,0:38:44.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,让你变成心目中的美女
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.06,0:38:58.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,苏珊,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.44,0:39:06.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.48,0:39:20.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.71,0:39:24.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把我变成心中的她
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.08,0:39:35.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.64,0:39:37.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是阿斯兰吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.77,0:39:40.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.38,0:39:58.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,咒语,使隐形的都显形
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.60,0:40:02.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就像心理学中的心
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.41,0:40:05.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,和精神病学中的神
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.03,0:40:08.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,隐形墨水和神学中的真理
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.08,0:40:09.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,凯斯宾,是露西的匕首
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.14,0:40:18.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,都给我站住,不许再前进了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.29,0:40:25.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这咒语念完了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.16,0:40:28.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在万物显形
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.79,0:40:53.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你们是什么生物  - 大怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.60,0:40:55.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有着老虎的头和
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.47,0:40:58.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,另一种老虎的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.28,0:41:01.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你不会想和我们杠上的  - 不然呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.71,0:41:04.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不然我就会爪子撕裂你们
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.22,0:41:08.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我会用爪一下穿透你的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.15,0:41:11.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我会用牙齿撕咬你
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.10,0:41:13.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我会用我的毒牙撕咬你
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.02,0:41:17.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是说用肥胖的肚子压死我们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.34,0:41:18.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们腹部肥胖吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.51,0:41:20.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,或是用你们的脚趾头给我们挠挠痒
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.11,0:41:25.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们这些小矮人对我妹妹做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.84,0:41:29.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 冷静点  - 她人在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.18,0:41:31.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我能告诉他吗  - 告诉他吧,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.47,0:41:34.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 在城堡里  - 什么城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.26,0:41:46.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那座城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.43,0:41:48.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我讨厌总是被你们抛在后面
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.89,0:41:51.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这城堡回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.34,0:41:55.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这地方变得越来越诡异了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.00,0:41:57.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他说我们诡异
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.59,0:42:03.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.71,0:42:05.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.20,0:42:08.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是凯斯宾和埃德蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.41,0:42:11.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是柯瑞金,这座岛的主人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.91,0:42:13.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这只是他个人的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.36,0:42:15.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,魔法师,你欺负我们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.45,0:42:17.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我可没欺负你们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.56,0:42:20.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我让你们隐形是为了保护你们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.08,0:42:21.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,保护我们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.02,0:42:23.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你这个凶恶的暴君
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.08,0:42:24.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我没有压迫你们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.26,0:42:26.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但你想压迫我们的话
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.02,0:42:27.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就能压迫我们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.49,0:42:29.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,给我消失吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.83,0:42:33.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.79,0:42:36.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,钱,别告诉他们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.61,0:42:42.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么生物  - 蹩脚仙
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.79,0:42:44.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,当然,我怎么傻了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.63,0:42:48.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你说你让他们隐形是为了保护他们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.94,0:42:51.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这话是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.38,0:42:53.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在我看来,那是保护他们不受恶魔伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.99,0:42:56.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,最简单的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.92,0:42:58.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是指那绿雾吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.56,0:43:02.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是指绿雾后面的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.00,0:43:22.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这可真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.00,0:43:33.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是说这图和这个世界一样活灵活现
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.36,0:43:36.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这里是问题的根源
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.77,0:43:40.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,黑暗之岛
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.41,0:43:43.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,恶魔藏匿之地
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.92,0:43:47.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,恶魔可以化身成任何形式
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.26,0:43:50.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,它可以实现你最黑暗的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.07,0:43:54.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,它要腐化世间的一切善
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.14,0:43:57.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,盗取世界上所有的光明
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.11,0:43:59.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们怎样才能阻止它
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.95,0:44:02.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们必须破除咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.01,0:44:05.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你带着的那把剑
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.33,0:44:07.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,另外还有六把
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.13,0:44:08.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你见过那六把剑吗  - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.69,0:44:11.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,六位勋爵,他们都来过这儿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.70,0:44:12.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.71,0:44:13.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们去哪儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.83,0:44:15.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,去了我送他们去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.55,0:44:21.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,要破除咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.25,0:44:24.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你必须要跟随蓝星
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.57,0:44:27.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,到达拉曼杜所在的星辰岛
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.35,0:44:31.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,七把剑必须都放在阿斯兰的餐桌上
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.80,0:44:36.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只能那样才能释放出真正的法力
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.15,0:44:40.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但是要小心
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.12,0:44:43.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们都要经受考验
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.33,0:44:45.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,考验
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.40,0:44:49.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们放下最后一把剑之前
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.56,0:44:52.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,恶魔都会主宰着局面
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.74,0:44:57.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,它会用尽一切手段来诱惑你们
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.62,0:45:05.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,要意志坚定
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.99,0:45:09.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要被诱惑所迷
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.74,0:45:13.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,要想战胜邪恶势力
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.98,0:45:17.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你必须先战胜自己内心的阴暗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.36,0:45:48.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,因为一些我无法理解的原由
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.53,0:45:51.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们采纳了那个老头愚蠢的建议
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.19,0:45:52.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他不刮胡子
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.78,0:45:55.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,而且还一直穿着长袍
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.44,0:45:57.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在,我们又回到这浴缸里
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.95,0:46:01.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,迷失在暴风雨中,好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.69,0:46:15.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,像平锅上的煎饼一样颠了十四天
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.59,0:46:18.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们仍看不见陆地
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.63,0:46:23.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,唯一的慰藉便是
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.38,0:46:26.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,所有人最终都变得和我一样沮丧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.87,0:46:31.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,除了那只爱卖弄会说话的老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.69,0:46:35.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他对任何事都保持令人厌恶的乐观态度
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.28,0:46:42.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,目前我们滞留在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.53,0:46:44.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,补给只剩一半
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.93,0:46:47.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,食物和水最多维持两周
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.22,0:46:52.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是最后的改变主意的机会了,陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.24,0:46:56.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,近期内不一定能看到蓝星
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.49,0:46:57.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,至少暴风雨中可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.52,0:47:01.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,寻找这片陌土犹如海底捞针
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.98,0:47:04.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们很可能航行过头最后到了世界尽头
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.56,0:47:06.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可能会被海蛇活活吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.13,0:47:11.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等船员们惊慌失措时就麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.09,0:47:14.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这片海域很诡异
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.53,0:47:17.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,海面泛出的光色我从没见过
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.79,0:47:19.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,船长,那么您一定很愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.93,0:47:21.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,亲自告知林斯先生我们打算放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.93,0:47:23.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,搜救她妻子
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.43,0:47:27.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我会继续努力
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.24,0:47:32.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只是给您提个醒
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.25,0:47:37.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,海洋会让水手的心里充满惶恐
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.77,0:47:40.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,惶恐万分
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.61,0:48:14.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,改变我之容貌
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.48,0:48:16.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,让人心生爱慕
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.47,0:48:19.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,睫毛,嘴唇,面容
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.34,0:48:22.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,让我变成心中的她
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.28,0:48:24.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,让我更加美丽
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.27,0:49:34.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们,欢迎佩文西小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.08,0:49:41.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.27,0:49:42.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,姐姐,你真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.08,0:49:44.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一直都那么美
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.49,0:49:45.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼德
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.09,0:49:48.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,打扰一下小姐,介意照张相吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.88,0:49:50.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈一定喜欢这样照片
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.60,0:49:52.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她三个儿女的合影
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.60,0:49:54.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,笑一笑
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.10,0:49:55.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,这是哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.61,0:49:57.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是说露西怎么没来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.89,0:50:00.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西,露西是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.21,0:50:02.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,苏珊,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.81,0:50:05.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小姐看这里,笑一下
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.98,0:50:08.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙,我不想这样,我想回去
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.65,0:50:09.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,回哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.81,0:50:11.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,回到纳尼亚去
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.88,0:50:12.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,纳尼亚是哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.50,0:50:14.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.63,0:50:16.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别照
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.38,0:50:24.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.76,0:50:27.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.12,0:50:32.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,孩子,你做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.33,0:50:38.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我也不知道,但感觉糟透了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.94,0:50:41.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但你那是你选的,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.46,0:50:44.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我并没打算那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.52,0:50:48.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我只不过是希望和苏珊一样美
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.47,0:50:50.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只是这些
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.96,0:50:56.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你希望自己消失掉,一发不可收拾
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.19,0:50:57.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果没有你
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.43,0:50:59.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们不会意识到纳尼亚的存在,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.14,0:51:03.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是第一个发现这里的,还记得吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.26,0:51:07.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.97,0:51:13.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要怀疑自己的价值,不要迷失自我
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.57,0:51:16.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.29,0:52:11.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,父皇,父皇
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.19,0:52:15.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙,埃德蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.06,0:52:21.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,跟我来吧,跟我走
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.70,0:52:26.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.90,0:52:31.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.88,0:52:37.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我睡不着
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.09,0:52:40.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我猜猜,又做噩梦了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.82,0:52:43.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看来要不我们全疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.80,0:52:47.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,要不就是有东西在扰乱我们的意志
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.28,0:53:11.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想勋爵们没来过这儿,陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.60,0:53:13.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这儿毫无生命的迹象
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.86,0:53:15.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没错,上岸后
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.58,0:53:18.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,带上你的人去寻找补给
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.43,0:53:20.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们三人去找线索
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.33,0:53:21.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,把我也算上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.38,0:53:26.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,求你了,别让我和那只老鼠待一起
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.64,0:53:28.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.49,0:53:31.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,耳朵真灵
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.53,0:53:33.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这句我也听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.44,0:53:53.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看,这儿有人迹
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.79,0:53:54.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,勋爵们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.36,0:53:56.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,也许吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.78,0:54:03.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得这下面会有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.69,0:54:05.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.89,0:54:44.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.46,0:54:48.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不清楚,看上去像是一尊金像
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.43,0:55:21.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他一定是失足坠入水中的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.70,0:55:23.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可怜的人
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.78,0:55:25.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他是勋爵
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.93,0:55:27.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,愿他的灵魂得以安息
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.48,0:55:28.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看,他的剑
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.83,0:55:30.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们需要它
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.20,0:55:34.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.48,0:55:41.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你的剑没有化作金子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.14,0:55:43.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,两把剑都蕴藏魔力
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.50,0:55:50.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他一定不知道是什么袭击了他
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.14,0:55:55.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,也许吧,但他也可能是来寻觅什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.84,0:55:58.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.89,0:56:19.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你在看什么
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.53,0:56:23.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,到过这水池的人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.51,0:56:28.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可以主宰整个世界
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.78,0:56:35.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西,我们非常富有
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.17,0:56:37.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没人能命令我们做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.14,0:56:39.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,或寄宿在谁哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.14,0:56:42.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,纳尼亚的东西你一样也带不走,埃德蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.05,0:56:43.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谁说的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.44,0:56:45.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我说的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.27,0:56:54.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是你的仆从
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.58,0:56:57.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你一直盼着这一刻,不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.71,0:56:59.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你一直想挑战我,你怀疑我的领导能力
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.71,0:57:01.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你自己都没信心
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.11,0:57:02.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你还是个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.00,0:57:03.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是个没骨气的窝囊货
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.47,0:57:04.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.22,0:57:06.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我厌倦当副手的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.37,0:57:08.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,之前是彼德,现在又换成了你
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.86,0:57:11.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你清楚我比你们两个都勇猛
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.13,0:57:13.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你凭什么拥有彼德的剑
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.63,0:57:15.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我才配拥有自己的国度
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.63,0:57:17.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我才配当国王
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.35,0:57:19.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你认为自己真的那么勇敢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.38,0:57:20.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那就证明给我看
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.75,0:57:25.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.10,0:57:30.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,都住手,看看你们自己
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.17,0:57:33.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,难道你们没发觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.85,0:57:36.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这地方在考验你们
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.00,0:57:38.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是在蛊惑你们
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.37,0:57:41.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这不正如柯瑞金所讲的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.31,0:57:44.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们离开这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.52,0:58:09.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,很好,顺着蓝星的指引
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.94,0:58:12.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,去什么星辰岛
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.63,0:58:17.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,会说话的狮子餐桌上的七把剑什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.47,0:58:20.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,全是胡扯
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.04,0:58:32.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.09,0:58:47.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我一定是死了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.75,0:59:16.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你确实是死了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.00,0:59:24.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不会需要这个的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.12,0:59:44.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,最终,事情终于出现好转了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.33,0:59:55.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,找到什么能吃的了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.11,1:00:01.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这儿是火山地质,物种不多,陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.40,1:00:03.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,尤斯提哪去了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.72,1:00:09.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他肯定没留下来帮我们装货
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.06,1:00:12.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,尤斯提
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.84,1:00:18.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我有不好的预感
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.43,1:00:19.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我去找他
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.52,1:00:21.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我也一起去
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.68,1:00:36.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,尤斯提
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.64,1:00:42.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,宝藏
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.99,1:00:46.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.09,1:00:57.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,尤斯提的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.50,1:01:03.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.37,1:01:13.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.34,1:01:15.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他还是个孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.61,1:01:19.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不该丢下他不管
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.92,1:01:25.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他会发生什么事
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.74,1:01:29.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这里吗,一切皆有可能
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.65,1:01:32.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,而且他不是第一个
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.08,1:01:36.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是巫大仙勋爵
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.98,1:01:45.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得找到他的剑
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.97,1:02:05.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.59,1:02:11.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,火山爆发了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.70,1:02:18.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不,那不是火山,全员集合
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.32,1:02:25.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,弓箭手,准备御敌
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.87,1:02:47.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,坚守阵地,听候发令
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.79,1:02:56.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,它想干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.82,1:02:57.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,发射
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.50,1:03:04.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他会毁掉桅杆的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.04,1:03:10.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.28,1:03:14.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,坚守阵地
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.48,1:03:17.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,发射
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.06,1:03:48.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.52,1:03:54.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.08,1:03:56.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.50,1:04:20.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(我是尤斯提)
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.28,1:04:25.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,开玩笑的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.27,1:04:38.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他一定是被那些宝藏诱惑了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.42,1:04:42.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,大家都知道龙的宝藏有魔力
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.48,1:04:45.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是说这里的人都知道
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.64,1:05:02.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有什么方法能让他复原吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.47,1:05:03.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我可不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.99,1:05:09.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,艾伯塔舅舅一定会发怒的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.61,1:05:12.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计,刺伤你手的事我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.42,1:05:15.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有时我是有些过火
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.51,1:05:17.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一切准备就绪了,先生
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.67,1:05:18.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不能把它丢下
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.94,1:05:21.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但我们也无法让他上船,陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.65,1:05:23.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你和其他人先坐船回去
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.67,1:05:25.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们留在这里过夜
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.67,1:05:27.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得想想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.30,1:05:28.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但您没有补给
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.79,1:05:31.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,也没有保暖的措施,陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.30,1:05:36.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你刚刚说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.56,1:05:47.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,从没见过这么美丽的星空
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.09,1:05:50.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我也没
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.35,1:05:54.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们远离家乡
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.18,1:05:58.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,儿时我常幻想能航行至世界的尽头
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.04,1:06:02.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在那里找到我父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.32,1:06:06.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,也许你会实现的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.95,1:06:22.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想妈妈了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.37,1:06:29.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.77,1:06:31.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心,你们一定会再见的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.50,1:06:33.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.61,1:06:36.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你要对此有信心
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.88,1:06:38.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰会帮助我们的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.47,1:06:48.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但阿斯兰没能阻止他们抓走我妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.47,1:06:52.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会找到她的,我保证
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.66,1:06:54.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一定会的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.69,1:07:23.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,睡不着吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.77,1:07:29.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,事情并不是你想象得那么糟糕
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.27,1:07:33.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不介意的话,我会在这陪着你
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.58,1:07:39.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,今早你一定还不相信这世上有龙
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.47,1:07:48.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,非凡的事只发生在非凡的人身上
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.16,1:07:52.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,也许这是个暗示
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.76,1:07:55.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,暗示着你将有非凡的命运
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.72,1:08:00.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,甚至非凡得超乎你的想象
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.47,1:08:04.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你想听
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.59,1:08:06.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以跟你分享些我的冒险经历
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.89,1:08:08.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,打发打发时间嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.36,1:08:11.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,信不信由你
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.07,1:08:13.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我以前就见过飞龙
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.07,1:08:16.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,记不得是多久之前了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.06,1:08:17.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是海盗中的一员
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.51,1:08:19.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们遭遇了一条飞龙
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.21,1:08:20.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那比你可凶猛多了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.65,1:08:35.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西,醒醒
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.34,1:08:37.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快看
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.74,1:08:40.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是蓝星
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.09,1:08:43.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 大家快看  - 什么
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.57,1:08:46.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,大家快醒醒,是蓝星
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.38,1:08:48.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快醒醒伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.24,1:09:27.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拉
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.25,1:09:32.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,用桨划过去,兄弟们,拉
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.75,1:09:35.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,风停了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.95,1:09:38.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那我们怎么才能到达星辰岛
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.79,1:09:42.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得是什么东西试图阻止我们
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.18,1:09:45.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拉
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.14,1:09:51.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要是饿急了,我就吃了那条龙
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.08,1:09:56.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心,尤斯提,想吃你他们得先问问我
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.05,1:09:59.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,晚上之前不能登陆的话
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.15,1:10:01.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真说不准吃了他
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.04,1:10:08.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们撞到什么了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.73,1:10:15.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,尤斯提,你真棒
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.53,1:10:24.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,上路啦
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.88,1:10:47.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不清楚其他几位勋爵
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.45,1:10:49.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是否成功到了星辰岛
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.20,1:11:02.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.61,1:11:07.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我说什么来着,尤斯提你是非凡的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.89,1:12:03.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.83,1:12:41.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,雷维林勋爵
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.22,1:12:47.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,马拉蒙勋爵
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.03,1:12:53.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿格茲勋爵
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.64,1:13:03.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他还有呼吸
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.57,1:13:11.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们也都活着
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.28,1:13:16.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们被诅咒了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.74,1:13:19.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,食物有诅咒
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.53,1:13:26.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看啊,是石刀,这是阿斯兰的餐桌
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.95,1:13:28.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,剑
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.46,1:13:38.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,让我来
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.26,1:13:49.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,六把
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.50,1:13:53.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还少一把
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.98,1:13:59.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快看
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.12,1:14:27.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,纳尼亚的旅行者们
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.20,1:14:29.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎你们
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.59,1:14:33.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,请起
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.99,1:14:37.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们都不饿吗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.19,1:14:39.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.21,1:14:40.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是莉莉安迪尔
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.45,1:14:43.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,星宿拉曼杜之女
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.63,1:14:45.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是你们的向导
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.18,1:14:50.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是蓝星
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.71,1:14:59.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你真是美极了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.10,1:15:02.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果这分散了你的注意力
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.22,1:15:04.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我可以换个外形  - 不
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.35,1:15:07.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,请吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.40,1:15:11.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,食物是为你们准备的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.89,1:15:14.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只要是受欢迎的人
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.28,1:15:15.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰的餐桌都会让他尽情享用
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.75,1:15:19.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,永远,请便吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.21,1:15:22.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.86,1:15:24.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.07,1:15:29.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这些可怜人来的时候就神志不清
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.35,1:15:31.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们互相残杀
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.59,1:15:34.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在阿斯兰的桌前是禁止暴力的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.94,1:15:37.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,所以他们被施了睡眠咒
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.32,1:15:38.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们会醒过来吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.59,1:15:41.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,当一切都恢复平静
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.66,1:15:44.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,过来,没有时间了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.58,1:16:04.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,魔法师柯瑞金告诉你们黑暗岛了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.02,1:16:07.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.03,1:16:14.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,最终恶魔将会势不可挡
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.72,1:16:17.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,柯瑞金说,如果要打破魔咒
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.10,1:16:19.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们需要把第七把剑放到阿斯兰的餐桌上
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.94,1:16:23.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他说得对  - 但是我们只找到了六把
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.75,1:16:25.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道第七把在哪儿吗
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.98,1:16:28.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在那里
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.96,1:16:31.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们需要很大的勇气
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.03,1:16:39.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在别再浪费时间了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.58,1:16:43.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们怎样才能再见面
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.94,1:16:47.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.16,1:17:16.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们觉得那里有什么
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.63,1:17:18.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们最恐怖的梦魇
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.78,1:17:21.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们最邪恶的欲望
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.69,1:17:24.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真正的恶魔
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.85,1:17:30.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,塔若斯,打开装备库
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.61,1:17:31.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是的,阁下
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.65,1:17:35.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,弓箭手,准备
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.58,1:17:37.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,向目标靠近
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.25,1:17:39.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们去准备一下
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.65,1:17:49.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,希望我长大后能像你一样
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.83,1:17:58.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等你长大了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.34,1:18:03.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你应该做你自己
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.69,1:18:14.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我们失败了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.98,1:18:16.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不管怎样...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.66,1:18:19.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想让你知道,我视你为兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.70,1:18:21.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.45,1:18:28.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你放弃了你的剑
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.91,1:18:31.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,它不属于我
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.78,1:18:36.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,用这把
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.82,1:18:39.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但它是...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.80,1:18:41.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼德会希望你用它的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.82,1:18:53.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就是那儿,我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.17,1:18:55.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,战斗就在眼前
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.50,1:18:58.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,尤斯提,不,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.19,1:19:00.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,尤斯提,停下来
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.21,1:19:01.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,停
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.25,1:19:05.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不接受放弃
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.62,1:19:08.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真正的勇士不会临阵脱逃
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.00,1:19:11.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看着我,我在跟你说话
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.39,1:19:18.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是只老鼠,你是一只龙
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.97,1:19:22.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你有坚硬的皮肤,你会喷火
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.76,1:19:25.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧,让我们面对我们的命运
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.73,1:19:34.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,无论这里发生什么
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.34,1:19:36.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,每个站在我面前的人
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.78,1:19:40.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,都是黎明踏浪号的一员
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.95,1:19:42.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们曾一起探险远行
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.64,1:19:46.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们曾一起历经磨难
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.62,1:19:48.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会一起再次胜利
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.61,1:19:50.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,所以现在不应该
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.55,1:19:53.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,害怕或受到诱惑,坚强起来
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.82,1:19:54.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,永不放弃
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.32,1:19:57.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是我们的世界
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.73,1:20:00.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,纳尼亚的精神
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.64,1:20:03.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,想想我们要去拯救的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.13,1:20:09.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,想想阿斯兰
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.26,1:20:14.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 想想纳尼亚  - 为纳尼亚而战
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.52,1:20:19.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为纳尼亚而战
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.59,1:21:16.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,伊莲
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.43,1:21:29.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们什么也看不见
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.77,1:21:31.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,雾太浓了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.14,1:21:40.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你真让我失望
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.41,1:21:43.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你也配做我的儿子吗
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.13,1:21:45.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还装模作样的像个国王
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.74,1:21:50.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.38,1:21:53.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.79,1:21:56.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,做我的国王
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.06,1:22:01.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我让你统治  - 滚开
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.75,1:22:02.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你已经死了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.90,1:22:04.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你永远杀不死我
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.82,1:22:11.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我永远活在你的意识里,傻孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.06,1:22:13.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不  - 埃德蒙
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.61,1:22:16.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.14,1:22:19.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.83,1:22:31.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,滚远点
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.70,1:22:34.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,滚远点
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.28,1:22:36.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谁在那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.88,1:22:40.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们不害怕你  - 真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.26,1:22:53.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 滚远点  - 我们不会离开
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.32,1:22:56.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们打不倒我
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.76,1:22:57.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,凯斯宾
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.64,1:22:59.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,凯斯宾,那把剑
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.66,1:23:02.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,路普勋爵
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.99,1:23:07.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你抓不住我
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.24,1:23:09.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,撤下
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.54,1:23:10.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,让他上船,快
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.08,1:23:22.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,冷静点,勋爵
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.63,1:23:24.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别碰我,恶魔们
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.75,1:23:25.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不,勋爵
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.15,1:23:29.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不会伤害你,我是你的国王
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.82,1:23:30.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,凯斯宾
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.09,1:23:38.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我的殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.01,1:23:43.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,您不应该来这里, 这里没有出路
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.38,1:23:46.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,趁现在不晚,赶快调转船头
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.12,1:23:48.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们拿到剑了,快走
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.70,1:23:50.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快点掉头
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.15,1:23:51.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,遵命,陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.98,1:23:53.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要想什么
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.16,1:23:56.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要让它知道你们的恐惧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.41,1:23:58.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,否则恐惧会成真
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.25,1:24:02.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不  - 埃德蒙
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.19,1:24:06.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你刚刚想什么了  - 对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.41,1:24:22.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.82,1:24:23.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.40,1:24:26.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,太晚了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.51,1:24:28.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,太晚了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.10,1:24:33.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,开船啊,快开船
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.41,1:24:34.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,盖尔
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.78,1:24:45.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,过来,走
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.01,1:24:50.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别让我失望,不害怕,不撤退
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.87,1:25:03.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为纳尼亚而战,尝尝这个
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.55,1:25:06.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还有这个
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.86,1:25:08.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,尤斯提,坚持住
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.80,1:25:40.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我要杀了它  - 不,剑
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.27,1:25:41.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那把剑
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.10,1:25:42.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,尤斯提
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.82,1:25:44.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,回来
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.45,1:25:47.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们难逃一死,难逃一死
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.62,1:25:49.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 调转船头  - 阻止他
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.58,1:25:51.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快阻止他
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.55,1:26:01.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,划船手,各就各位
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.35,1:26:07.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 全速前进  - 阿斯兰,请帮助我们
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.52,1:26:15.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拉
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.05,1:26:18.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拉
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.04,1:26:39.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拉
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.76,1:26:48.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.18,1:27:03.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在别人来救你之前,待在这儿别动
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.41,1:27:10.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.37,1:27:14.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德,我们引着海蛇,把它撞到石头上
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.47,1:27:17.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你来掌舵,我来掩护
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.73,1:27:20.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.53,1:27:25.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拉
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.73,1:27:27.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拉
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.35,1:27:37.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来杀我啊,来啊,来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.53,1:27:43.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不  - 埃德蒙
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.81,1:28:02.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我还在这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.56,1:28:12.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,站稳了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.38,1:29:27.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快跑
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.75,1:29:44.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们能打败它
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.96,1:30:05.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们得靠的更近  - 所有人去甲板上
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.76,1:30:07.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,长矛手准备
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.20,1:30:14.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,所有人都过来
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.86,1:30:20.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,准备
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.70,1:30:22.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,扔
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.63,1:30:30.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把他的头拉下来
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.12,1:30:53.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抛
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.95,1:31:02.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.24,1:31:11.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你在试着证明什么吗,埃德蒙
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.27,1:31:13.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,证明你是个男子汉吗
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.35,1:31:25.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拉
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.98,1:31:27.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我能助你一臂之力
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.53,1:31:29.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以让你成为我的国王
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.98,1:31:33.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抓住我的手
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.71,1:31:49.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把手给我就行
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.31,1:32:00.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,杀死它
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.97,1:32:02.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.92,1:32:09.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.56,1:32:44.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,咒语,被解除了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.77,1:32:49.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.22,1:32:53.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,凯斯宾,看
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.80,1:33:24.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是纳尼亚人
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.08,1:33:25.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,纳尼亚人
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.03,1:33:43.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 妈妈  - 伊莲
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.54,1:33:55.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,林斯,盖尔
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.14,1:33:56.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.99,1:34:02.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.07,1:34:10.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,清理甲板,让他们上船
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.63,1:34:17.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们成功了,我知道我们会成功的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.60,1:34:21.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不只是我们  - 你是说
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.49,1:34:24.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我在这儿,露西
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.52,1:34:25.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.82,1:34:28.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这边,露西,我在水里,露西
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.37,1:34:29.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,尤斯提
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.76,1:34:32.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我又变回人了,变成人了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.98,1:34:36.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,尤斯提,我看到你的翅膀消失了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.77,1:34:44.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,水天相接之地,海浪甜蜜翻涌
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.12,1:34:46.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这水是甜的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.42,1:34:47.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这水是甜的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.97,1:34:50.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.29,1:34:52.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.07,1:35:00.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰的国家
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.68,1:35:02.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们肯定很接近了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.88,1:35:06.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们走了这么远
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.47,1:35:21.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰把你变回来时,你感觉如何
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.92,1:35:26.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,无论我怎么努力,我都动不了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.67,1:35:30.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,然后他走过来,有点疼,但是...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.16,1:35:32.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,很值得
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.24,1:35:36.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就像把剑从脚里拔出来
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.88,1:35:39.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,做只龙也不坏
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.02,1:35:43.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,至少我做龙时比做人更好
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.59,1:35:46.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉,我总是抱怨
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.85,1:35:50.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没关系,尤斯提,你曾是条好龙
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.04,1:35:58.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,朋友们,我们到了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.90,1:36:36.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.18,1:36:41.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎,孩子们,你们干得不错
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.40,1:36:42.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,确实很棒
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.28,1:36:44.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们从遥远的地方而来
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.50,1:36:47.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在你们的旅程结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.36,1:36:50.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是您的国家吗
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.28,1:36:52.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不,我的国家在后面
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.06,1:36:57.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我的父亲在您的国家吗
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.86,1:37:01.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你需要自己去寻找,我的孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.61,1:37:05.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但你要知道一旦你继续,就无法回头
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.76,1:37:39.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不去吗
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.25,1:37:41.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我放弃了父亲为之牺牲的国度
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.37,1:37:44.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,父皇肯定会很生气
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.34,1:37:48.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我花了太长时间追寻
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.50,1:37:50.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我失去的东西,而不是我得到的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.34,1:37:53.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我得到了王国
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.62,1:37:56.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,人民
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.16,1:38:05.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我保证会成为一位好国王
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.60,1:38:07.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你已经是了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.87,1:38:09.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,孩子们
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.17,1:38:13.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我们是时间回家了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.52,1:38:19.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我以为你喜欢这里  - 确实
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.12,1:38:23.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但是我也爱故乡和家人
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.17,1:38:27.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们需要我们
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.94,1:38:39.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阁下,从我记事起
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.06,1:38:41.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我就盼望着能见识您的国家
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.04,1:38:44.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我在这个世界经历了很多冒险
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.57,1:38:48.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但是这个愿望始终没有泯灭
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.31,1:38:51.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道我不配,但是希望您能允许...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.23,1:38:54.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我会欣然放下剑
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.89,1:38:58.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,亲眼去见识您的国家
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.62,1:39:06.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我的国度为你们这种高尚之心而建
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.11,1:39:09.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,无论你多么矮小
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.20,1:39:13.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 陛下  - 没人比你更适合了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.24,1:39:14.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.58,1:39:30.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以吗
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.54,1:39:34.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想...就这样了...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.63,1:39:40.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,再见,露西
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.89,1:39:57.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别哭
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.10,1:40:00.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不明白
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.37,1:40:06.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,什么时候我还能见到你
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.02,1:40:09.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你真是一个谜
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.96,1:40:11.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,也是一个英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.56,1:40:14.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,能和你并肩作战是我的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.02,1:40:15.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是真正的勇士
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.62,1:40:16.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真正的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.71,1:40:31.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不再需要这个了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.40,1:41:01.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是我们最后一次来这里了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.60,1:41:02.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.90,1:41:05.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你已经长大了,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.26,1:41:08.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就像彼德和苏珊
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.77,1:41:10.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你会来我们的世界看我们吗
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.63,1:41:14.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我始终都在注视着你们
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.18,1:41:19.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么会  - 在你们的世界...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.11,1:41:24.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我有另外一个名字,你们会由此找到我
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.08,1:41:27.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这也是你们来到纳尼亚的原因
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.19,1:41:30.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在这里对我多一些了解
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.07,1:41:33.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在那边你能更好地了解我
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.32,1:41:35.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们还会再见吗
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.27,1:41:40.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是的,亲爱的,总有一天
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.63,1:41:57.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们就像我的家人一样
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.30,1:42:02.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,也包括你,尤斯提
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.50,1:42:05.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.22,1:42:35.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我还会回来吗
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.92,1:42:38.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,纳尼亚也许还会需要你
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.67,1:43:36.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,尤斯提
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.14,1:43:42.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,尤斯提,你在上面干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.80,1:43:45.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,姬兒来看你了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.61,1:43:59.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,之后的一段时间我们总谈论纳尼亚
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.23,1:44:03.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,直到他们离开
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.93,1:44:06.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,战争结束之后...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.69,1:44:10.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我十分想念他们
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.41,1:44:14.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想纳尼亚人也会想念他们的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.93,1:44:17.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,直到永远
